ent-ClothingBackpack = 後背包 | backpack
    .desc = 將它背在背上，然後把物品放進去。 | You wear this on your back and put items into it.
ent-ClothingBackpackClown = 吉格爾斯·馮·洪克頓 | giggles von honkerton
    .desc = 這是 Honk! Co. 生產的一款背包。 | It's a backpack made by Honk! Co.
ent-ClothingBackpackIan = 伊恩的背包 | Ian's backpack
    .desc = 有時候他會戴上它。 | Sometimes he wears it.
ent-ClothingBackpackSecurity = 安全背包 | security backpack
    .desc = 這是一款非常堅固的背包。 | It's a very robust backpack.
ent-ClothingBackpackBrigmedic = 軍用醫療背包 | brigmedic backpack
    .desc = 這是一款非常簡約的背包。 | It's a very sterile backpack.
ent-ClothingBackpackEngineering = 工程背包 | engineering backpack
    .desc = 這是一款專為應對太空站生活的日常繁忙而設計的耐用背包。 | It's a tough backpack for the daily grind of station life.
ent-ClothingBackpackAtmospherics = atmospherics 後背包 | atmospherics backpack
    .desc = 這是一款由耐火纖維製成的背包。散發著等離子體般的氣味。 | It's a backpack made of fire resistant fibers. Smells like plasma.
ent-ClothingBackpackMedical = 醫療背包 | medical backpack
    .desc = 這是一款專為無菌環境使用而設計的背包。 | It's a backpack especially designed for use in a sterile environment.
ent-ClothingBackpackCaptain = 船長的背包 | captain's backpack
    .desc = 這是一款專為 Nanotrasen 警員特別設計的背包。 | It's a special backpack made exclusively for Nanotrasen officers.
ent-ClothingBackpackMime = mime 後背包 | mime backpack
    .desc = 專為那些默默無聞的工作者設計的靜音背包。Silence Co. | A silent backpack made for those silent workers. Silence Co.
ent-ClothingBackpackChemistry = 化學背包 | chemistry backpack
    .desc = 一款專為防污及抵禦危險液體而設計的背包。 | A backpack specially designed to repel stains and hazardous liquids.
ent-ClothingBackpackHydroponics = 水耕背包 | hydroponics backpack
    .desc = 這是一款由全天然纖維製成的背包。 | It's a backpack made of all-natural fibers.
ent-ClothingBackpackScience = 科學背包 | science backpack
    .desc = 一款專為防污及抵禦危險液體而設計的背包。 | A backpack specially designed to repel stains and hazardous liquids.
