ent-ChangelingFleshClothingSuitStorage = changeling flesh gas tank
    .desc = { ent-ChangelingFleshClothingBase.desc }
    .suffix = { ent-ChangelingFleshClothingBase.suffix }
ent-ClothingMultipleHeadphones = 耳機 | headphones
    .desc = Drunk Masters 出品的高品質耳機，隔音效果良好。 | Quality headphones from Drunk Masters, with good sound insulation.
ent-BaseTowel = 基礎毛巾 | base towel
    .desc = 如果你想在這兒生存下去，就得知道你的毛巾放哪裡。 | If you want to survive out here, you gotta know where your towel is.
ent-TowelColorWhite = 白色毛巾 | white towel
    .desc = { ent-BaseTowel.desc }
ent-TowelColorNT = NanoTrasen 品牌毛巾 | NanoTrasen brand towel
    .desc = { ent-BaseTowel.desc }
ent-TowelColorCentcom = 中央司令部毛巾 | centcom towel
    .desc = { ent-BaseTowel.desc }
ent-TowelColorSyndicate = 辛迪加毛巾 | syndicate towel
    .desc = { ent-BaseTowel.desc }
ent-ClothingNeckBase = { ent-SolutionFood }
    .desc = { ent-SolutionFood.desc }
ent-ClothingScarfBase = { ent-ClothingNeckBase }
    .desc = { ent-TemperatureProtectionMinimal.desc }
ent-ClothingNeckCloakCentcom = 中央指揮官的斗篷 | central commander's cloak
    .desc = 一件華麗而高雅的綠色斗篷，飾有精美的金色滾邊，是專為中央指揮官量身訂製的。這件斗篷重得驚人，那金色的滾邊說不定是真金做的。 | A pompous and elite green cloak with a nice gold trim, tailored specifically to the Central Commander. It's so heavy, the gold trim might be real.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakCap = 船長斗篷 | captain's cloak
    .desc = 一件華麗又舒適的藍色斗篷，邊緣綴有精美的金色滾邊；雖然不像你其他財物那樣特別珍貴，但確實很講究。 | A pompous and comfy blue cloak with a nice gold trim, while not particularly valuable as your other possessions, it sure is fancy.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakHos = 安全主管的斗篷 | head of security's cloak
    .desc = 一件精緻的深紅長袍，專為那些能對不法之徒展現統治權威之人而製。在起訴過程中，試著表現得體面些吧！ | An exquisite dark and red cloak fitting for those who can assert dominance over wrongdoers. Take a stab at being civil in prosecution!
ent-ClothingNeckCloakCe = 首席工程師的斗篷 | chief engineer's cloak
    .desc = 一件飾有淺藍色紋樣的深綠色斗篷，頒發給那些證明自己已精通精確工程部藝術的人士。 | A dark green cloak with light blue ornaments, given to those who proved themselves to master the precise art of engineering.
ent-ClothingCloakCmo = 首席醫務官的斗篷 | chief medical officer's cloak
    .desc = 一件綴有綠色十字的純淨藍色斗篷，散發出一種盡責與樂於助人的氣質。 | A sterile blue cloak with a green cross, radiating with a sense of duty and willingness to help others.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakRd = 科學主任的斗篷 | research director's cloak
    .desc = 一件帶有紫色條紋的白袍，彰顯您作為尖端科技仲裁者的身分。 | A white cloak with violet stripes, showing your status as the arbiter of cutting-edge technology.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakQm = 司務長斗篷 | quartermaster's cloak
    .desc = 一件帶有反光條紋的厚實棕色斗篷，雖然不如其他款式華麗，但確實展現了你的管理能力。 | A strong brown cloak with a reflective stripe, while not as fancy as others, it does show your managing skills.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakHop = 人事主管的斗篷 | head of personnel's cloak
    .desc = 一件藍色斗篷，肩部飾有紅色鑲邊，並綴有金色鈕扣，證明你是太空站內任何氣閘的守門人。 | A blue cloak with red shoulders and gold buttons, proving you are the gatekeeper to any airlock on the station.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakHerald = 先驅者的斗篷 | herald's cloak
    .desc = 一件看起來邪惡的紅色斗篷，肩部綴有尖刺。 | An evil-looking red cloak with spikes on its shoulders.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakNanotrasen = NanoTrasen 斗篷 | nanotrasen cloak
    .desc = 一件氣派的藍色斗篷，用以象徵 NanoTrasen。 | A stately blue cloak to represent NanoTrasen.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakCapFormal = 船長禮服斗篷 | captain's formal cloak
    .desc = 一件華麗且裝飾精美的斗篷，專為特殊場合而設計。 | A lavish and decorated cloak for special occasions.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakAdmin = weh 斗篷 | weh cloak
    .desc = 哇！ | Weh!
ent-ClothingNeckCloakSalvagerSupreme = 至高救贖者之斗篷 | supereme salvager's cloak
    .desc = 這是由最嫻熟的回收者所穿戴的裝備，專為那些已駕馭太空、並將採礦小行星視為自己地盤的人而設。你知道的，這種東西可不是隨便就能拿到的。 | Worn by the most skilled salvagers, for one who has mastered space and made the mining asteroid his domain. They don't just hand these things out, y'know?
ent-ClothingNeckCloakTrans = 吸血鬼斗篷 | vampire cloak
    .desc = 由特蘭西瓦尼亞吸血鬼社會中的高階吸血鬼所佩戴。 | Worn by high ranking vampires of the transylvanian society of vampires.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakGoliathCloak = 巨人斗篷 | goliath cloak
    .desc = 這件斗篷是由遙遠星球上某種韌性極強的動物皮製成，儘管隨著歲月流逝，其防護功效已大為減弱。 | A cloak made from the hide of resilient fauna from a distant planet, though its protective value has faded with its age.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakPirateCap = 海盜船長斗篷 | pirate captain cloak
    .desc = 一件頗為迷人的黑色海盜斗篷，上面還綴有骷髏圖案。 | A rather fetching black pirate cloak, complete with skull motif.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakMoth = 飛蛾斗篷 | moth cloak
    .desc = 一件形似蛾翼的斗篷，是衣櫥中既獨特又別出心裁的單品，能吸引他人的目光。它採用仿蛾翼紋理的輕薄布料製成，邊緣柔軟蓬鬆。這件斗篷以綁帶繫於頸部，並配有形似蛾頭的兜帽。 | A cloak in the form of moth wings is an unusual and original element of the wardrobe that can attract the attention of others. It is made of a thin fabric imitating moth wings, with soft and fluffy edges. The raincoat is fastened around the neck with straps, and has a hood in the shape of a moths head.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakVoid = void cloak | void cloak
    .desc = 一片黑暗的斗篷。獻給那些已投身原力黑暗面的人們。 | A cloak of darkness. For those who have gone to the dark side of the force.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakAce = 飛行員斗篷 | pilot's cloak
    .desc = 「隱形斗篷」是授予納諾特拉森最頂尖太空王牌的獎勵。 | Cloak awarded to Nanotrasen's finest space aces.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakAro = 狼人斗篷 | werewolf cloak
    .desc = 這件斗篷讓別人知道你是一匹獨行狼。 | This cloak lets others know you're a lone wolf.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakAroace = 飛行員的斗篷
    .desc = 在擁有適居大氣的行星上，這件斗篷會頒發給 NanoTrasen 最優秀的飛行員。 | Cloak awarded to Nanotrasen's finest pilots on planets with inhabitable atmospheres.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakBi = 毒斗篷 | poison cloak
    .desc = 紫色是表明你有毒的明顯徵兆。 | The purple color is a clear indicator you are poisonous.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakIntersex = 獨眼巨人斗篷 | cyclops cloak
    .desc = 這件斗篷上的圓圈象徵著獨眼巨人的一隻眼睛。 | The circle on this cloak represents a cyclops' eye.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakLesbian = 詩人之袍 | poet cloak
    .desc = 這件斗篷曾屬於一位古代詩人，你已經忘記是誰了。 | This cloak belonged to an ancient poet, you forgot which one.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakGay = 多層次行銷的偽裝 | multi-level marketing cloak
    .desc = 這件斗篷在 NanoTrasen 的行銷辦公室裡極受追捧。 | This cloak is highly sought after in the Nanotrasen Marketing Offices.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakEnby = 尋寶者斗篷 | treasure hunter cloak
    .desc = 這件斗篷原本屬於一名貪婪的尋寶者。 | This cloak belonged to a greedy treasure hunter.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakPan = 主廚披風 | chef's cloak
    .desc = 本產品設計為與平底鍋搭配使用。 | Meant to be worn alongside a frying pan.
ent-ClothingNeckMantleCap = 船長之袍 | captain's mantle
    .desc = 一件舒適又時尚的斗篷，唯有最資深的船長才配得上。 | A comfortable and chique mantle befitting of only the most experienced captain.
ent-ClothingNeckMantleCE = 總工程師的重任 | chief engineer's mantle
    .desc = 高可見度，已確認。RIG 系統，已確認。高容量電池，已確認。一位首席工程師所需的一切，皆融入這款時尚的外殼之中。 | High visibility, check. RIG system, check. High capacity cell, check. Everything a chief engineer could need in a stylish mantle.
ent-ClothingNeckMantleCMO = 醫務總管的重任 | chief medical officer's mantle
    .desc = 對於一位曾待過足夠多醫療艙、因而深知「個人防護裝備（PPE）穿得越多，輪班結束後就越不需要去中央指揮部乾洗」的首席營銷官（CMO）來說。 | For a CMO that has been in enough medbays to know that more PPE means less central command dry cleaning visits when the shift is over.
ent-ClothingNeckMantleHOP = 人事主管的職責 | head of personnel's mantle
    .desc = 一位優秀的 HOP 都知道，處理文書工作只是工作的一半……另一半則是摸摸你的狗，並保持時尚造型。 | A good HOP knows that paper pushing is only half the job... petting your dog and looking fashionable is the other half.
ent-ClothingNeckMantleHOS = 安全主管的職責 | head of security's mantle
    .desc = 對這位警署署長而言，與犯罪集團特工的槍戰不過是平凡的週二罷了。這件警服正是他對警署奉獻精神的象徵。 | Shootouts with syndicate agents are just another Tuesday for this HoS. This mantle is a symbol of commitment to the station.
ent-ClothingNeckMantleRD = 科學主任的重任 | research director's mantle
    .desc = 畢竟，當你在辦公室度過漫長的一天，周遭充斥著炸藥、毒氣、殺人機器人，還有從貨艙送來的剛出爐披薩時，這件斗篷能讓你保持舒適。 | For when long days in the office consist of explosives, poisonous gas, murder robots, and a fresh pizza from cargo; this mantle will keep you comfy.
ent-ClothingNeckMantleQM = 司務長的大袍 | quartermaster's mantle
    .desc = 讓物資與材料的主宰者統籌管理該部門，這件相稱的斗篷正是彰顯其優越地位的絕佳象徵！ | For the master of goods and materials to rule over the department, a befitting mantle to show off superiority!
ent-ClothingNeckMantle = 地幔 | mantle
    .desc = 一件柔軟的外套，採用與那件標誌性冬季大衣相同的「合成」動物毛皮製成。 | A soft mantle, made with the same 'synthetic' animal furs of the iconic winter coat.
ent-ClothingNeckMedalBase = 獎牌 | medal
    .desc = 一枚彰顯你勇氣的獎章。可能由金屬製成，也可能不是。 | A medal to show your mettle. May or may not be made of metal.
ent-ClothingNeckBronzeheart = 青銅之心勳章 | bronzeheart medal
    .desc = 頒發給在面對危險時展現出卓越勇氣的船員。 | Given to crewmates for exemplary bravery in the face of danger.
ent-ClothingNeckGoldmedal = 團隊合作金牌 | gold medal of crewmanship
    .desc = 頒發給展現出卓越團隊精神的船員。 | Given to crewmates who display excellent crewmanship.
ent-ClothingNeckCargomedal = 貨運勳章 | cargo medal
    .desc = 頒發予貨運部門表現最優異者。 | Given for the best work in the cargo department.
ent-ClothingNeckEngineermedal = 工程師獎章 | engineer medal
    .desc = 頒發予工程系最傑出的作品。 | Given for the best work in the engineering department.
ent-ClothingNeckMedicalmedal = 醫學獎章 | medical medal
    .desc = 頒發予醫學系中最傑出的作品。 | Given for the best work in the medical department.
ent-ClothingNeckSciencemedal = 科學獎章 | science medal
    .desc = 頒發予科學系中最優秀的作品。 | Given for the best work in the science department.
ent-ClothingNeckSecuritymedal = 安全勳章 | security medal
    .desc = 頒發予安全部門中表現最優異者。 | Given for the best work in the security department.
ent-ClothingNeckClownmedal = 小丑勳章 | clown medal
    .desc = 頒發給宇宙中最棒的笑話。嗷——！ | Given for the best joke in the universe. HONK!
ent-ClothingNeckStethoscope = 聽診器 | stethoscope
    .desc = 一款過時的醫療儀器，用來聽取人體的聲音。它還能讓你看起來像個行家。 | An outdated medical apparatus for listening to the sounds of the human body. It also makes you look like you know what you're doing.
ent-ActionStethoscope = 用聽診器聽診 | Listen with stethoscope
    .desc = { ent-BaseAction.desc }
ent-ClothingNeckBling = bling | bling
    .desc = 該死，當個黑幫分子真爽。 | Damn, it feels good to be a gangster.
ent-ClothingNeckLawyerbadge = 律師證章 | lawyer badge
    .desc = 一枚徽章，用以證明持有者是通過北領地律師資格考試、具備執業資格的「合法」律師。 | A badge to show that the owner is a 'legitimate' lawyer who passed the NT bar exam required to practice law.
ent-Dinkystar = 星星貼紙 | star sticker
    .desc = 一顆小小的星星，專獻給最勤奮的保全人員！它甚至已經不黏了。 | A dinky lil star for only the hardest working security officers! It's not even sticky anymore.
ent-ClothingNeckPinBase = pin | pin
    .desc = 一事無成，卻去犯罪。 | Be nothing do crime.
ent-ClothingGenderPinBase = { ent-ClothingNeckPinBase }
    .desc = { ent-ClothingNeckPinBase.desc }
ent-ClothingNeckLGBTPin = LGBT 別針 | LGBT pin
    .desc = 當個同性戀，去犯罪吧。 | Be gay do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckAllyPin = 異性戀盟友別針 | straight ally pin
    .desc = 當盟友，犯下罪行。 | Be ally do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckAromanticPin = 無浪漫傾向的徽章 | aromantic pin
    .desc = 提高犯罪警覺。 | Be aro do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckAroacePin = aroace 別針 | aroace pin
    .desc = 保持警惕，防範犯罪。 | Be aroace do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckAsexualPin = 無性愛別針 | asexual pin
    .desc = 當個犯罪高手。 | Be ace do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckBisexualPin = 雙性戀別針 | bisexual pin
    .desc = 當個雙性戀，去犯罪吧。 | Be bi do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckGayPin = 同志別針 | gay pin
    .desc = 當個同志～去犯罪吧。 | Be gay~ do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckIntersexPin = 雙性人別針 | intersex pin
    .desc = 身為雙性人，就得犯罪。 | Be intersex do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckLesbianPin = 女同志別針 | lesbian pin
    .desc = 當女同志，去犯罪。 | Be lesbian do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckNonBinaryPin = 非二元接腳 | non-binary pin
    .desc = 01100010 01100101 00100000 01100101 01101110 01100010 01111001 00100000 01100100 01101111 00100000 01100011 01110010 01101001 01101101 01100101 | 01100010 01100101 00100000 01100101 01101110 01100010 01111001 00100000 01100100 01101111 00100000 01100011 01110010 01101001 01101101 01100101
ent-ClothingNeckPansexualPin = 全性戀別針 | pansexual pin
    .desc = 犯下罪行吧。 | Be pan do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckPluralPin = 複數的別針 | plural pin
    .desc = 結伴而行，犯下罪行。 | Be plural, do crimes.
ent-ClothingNeckOmnisexualPin = 全性戀別針 | omnisexual pin
    .desc = 凡事皆可為罪。 | Be omni do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckGenderqueerPin = 性別流動別針 | genderqueer pin
    .desc = 犯罪，性別 | be crime, do gender
ent-ClothingNeckGenderfluidPin = 性別流動別針 | genderfluid pin
    .desc = 做自己，活出流動性 | be gender, be fluid
ent-ClothingNeckTransPin = 跨性別徽章 | transgender pin
    .desc = 身為跨性別者就得犯罪。 | Be trans do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckAutismPin = 神經多樣性別針 | neurodivergent pin
    .desc = 身為神經多樣性者，去犯罪吧。 | Be neurodivergent, do crime.
ent-ClothingNeckGoldAutismPin = 自閉症別針 | autism pin
    .desc = 患有自閉症，就去犯罪吧。 | Be autistic, do crime.
ent-SprayFlowerPin = 花形胸針 | flower pin
    .desc = 一枚可愛的花朵胸針。總覺得它哪裡不太對勁…… | A cute flower pin. Something seems off with it...
ent-ClothingNeckScarfStripedRed = 條紋紅圍巾 | striped red scarf
    .desc = 一條時尚的紅色條紋圍巾。無論是對時尚有敏銳嗅覺的人，還是單純無法忍受寒風吹拂頸部的人，這都是完美的冬季配飾。 | A stylish striped red scarf. The perfect winter accessory for those with a keen fashion sense, and those who just can't handle a cold breeze on their necks.
ent-ClothingNeckScarfStripedBlue = 藍色條紋圍巾 | striped blue scarf
    .desc = 一條時尚的藍色條紋圍巾。無論是對時尚頗有敏銳嗅覺的人，還是那些實在受不了寒風吹拂脖頸的人，這都是完美的冬季配飾。 | A stylish striped blue scarf. The perfect winter accessory for those with a keen fashion sense, and those who just can't handle a cold breeze on their necks.
ent-ClothingNeckScarfStripedGreen = 綠色條紋圍巾 | striped green scarf
    .desc = 一條時尚的綠色條紋圍巾。無論是對時尚極具敏銳度的人，還是單純無法忍受寒風吹拂頸部的人，這都是完美的冬季配飾。 | A stylish striped green scarf. The perfect winter accessory for those with a keen fashion sense, and those who just can't handle a cold breeze on their necks.
ent-ClothingNeckScarfStripedBlack = 條紋黑色圍巾 | striped black scarf
    .desc = 一條時尚的黑色條紋圍巾。無論是對時尚極具敏銳度的人士，還是單純無法忍受寒風拂過頸項的人，這都是完美的冬季配飾。 | A stylish striped black scarf. The perfect winter accessory for those with a keen fashion sense, and those who just can't handle a cold breeze on their necks.
ent-ClothingNeckScarfStripedBrown = 棕色條紋圍巾 | striped brown scarf
    .desc = 一條時尚的棕色條紋圍巾。無論是對時尚極具敏銳度的人，還是單純無法忍受寒風拂過頸項的人，這都是完美的冬季配飾。 | A stylish striped brown scarf. The perfect winter accessory for those with a keen fashion sense, and those who just can't handle a cold breeze on their necks.
ent-ClothingNeckScarfStripedLightBlue = 淺藍色條紋圍巾 | striped light blue scarf
    .desc = 一條時尚的淺藍色條紋圍巾。無論是對時尚極具敏銳度的人，還是無法忍受頸部被冷風吹拂的人，這都是完美的冬季配飾。 | A stylish striped light blue scarf. The perfect winter accessory for those with a keen fashion sense, and those who just can't handle a cold breeze on their necks.
ent-ClothingNeckScarfStripedOrange = 橘色條紋圍巾 | striped orange scarf
    .desc = 一條時尚的橘色條紋圍巾。無論是對時尚極具敏銳度的人，還是無法忍受寒風拂過頸部的人，這都是完美的冬季配飾。 | A stylish striped orange scarf. The perfect winter accessory for those with a keen fashion sense, and those who just can't handle a cold breeze on their necks.
ent-ClothingNeckScarfStripedPurple = 條紋紫色圍巾 | striped purple scarf
    .desc = 一條時尚的紫色條紋圍巾。無論是對時尚極具敏銳度的人，還是單純無法忍受寒風拂過頸部的人，這都是完美的冬季配飾。 | A stylish striped purple scarf. The perfect winter accessory for those with a keen fashion sense, and those who just can't handle a cold breeze on their necks.
ent-ClothingNeckScarfStripedSyndieGreen = 條紋辛迪加綠色圍巾 | striped syndicate green scarf
    .desc = 一條時尚的條紋辛迪加綠圍巾。對於那些擁有敏銳時尚觸覺的人，以及正想偷點什麼的人來說，這正是完美的冬季配飾。 | A stylish striped syndicate green scarf. The perfect winter accessory for those with a keen fashion sense, and those who are in the mood to steal something.
ent-ClothingNeckScarfStripedSyndieRed = 條紋辛迪加紅色圍巾 | striped syndicate red scarf
