    .desc = 一件復古風格的藍色法蘭絨夾克，適合太空秋日。 | An old fashioned blue flannel jacket for space autumn.
ent-ClothingOuterFlannelGreen = 綠色法蘭絨夾克 | green flannel jacket
    .desc = 一件復古風格的綠色法蘭絨夾克，適合太空般的秋日。 | An old fashioned green flannel jacket for space autumn.
ent-ClothingOuterRedRacoon = 紅色浣熊裝 | red racoon suit
    .desc = 毛茸茸的紅色浣熊套裝！ | Fluffy suit of red racoon!
ent-WiredApronBase = 鋼絲圍裙 | wired apron
    .desc = 一條綴有編織線的圍裙。看起來似乎尚未完成。 | An apron threaded with cabling. It looks incomplete.
ent-SteelApronBase = 鋼製護裙 | steel-covered apron
    .desc = 一件用多餘電纜隨意固定的、帶有鋼板襯裡的圍裙。以目前的狀態而言，一旦穿上，它會立刻散架。 | An apron with steel plating haphazardly affixed by spare cabling. In it's current state, it would fall apart immediately if worn.
ent-WeldedSteelApronBase = 焊接鋼製圍裙 | welded steel apron
    .desc = 一件附有焊接鋼板的護甲，該鋼板固定在備用纜線上。這套護甲已不再有解體的危險，但仍需進行額外加工才能確保穿戴穩固。 | An apron affixed with welded steel plating attached to spare cabling. The armor is no longer in danger of falling apart, but requires additional work to be worn securely.
ent-ClothingOuterArmorScrap = 廢棄盔甲 | scrap armor
    .desc = 一名tider閃閃發光的板甲。站住，否則你死定了。 | A tider's gleaming plate mail. Bail up, or you're a dead man.
ent-ClothingOuterHardsuitEVA = EVA 防護服 | EVA suit
    .desc = 一款輕量級太空服，具備保護穿著者免受太空真空環境侵害的基本能力。 | A lightweight space suit with the basic ability to protect the wearer from the vacuum of space.
ent-ClothingOuterEVASuitSyndicate = 辛迪加 EVA 戰衣 | syndicate EVA suit
    .desc = 背面貼有標籤，上面寫著：「這絕對不是敵對企業的財產，真的！」 | Has a tag on the back that reads: 'Totally not property of an enemy corporation, honest!'
ent-ClothingOuterSuitEmergency = 緊急壓力服 | emergency pressure suit
    .desc = 這套笨重且未經隔熱處理的壓力服，顯然並非為在太空中長時間使用而設計，儘管 NanoTrasen 聲稱它符合公司規定。 | This bulky, uninsulated pressure suit was clearly not meant for extended use in outer space, despite NanoTrasen's claims that it passes corporate regulations.
ent-ClothingOuterHardsuitEVAPrisoner = 囚犯壓力服 | prisoner pressure suit
    .desc = 一款專為囚犯設計的緊急壓力服。雖然它未經全面認證，無法在太空中長時間使用，但有些獄警卻將其缺乏隔熱功能視為一項特點。 | An emergency pressure suit meant for prisoners. It's not fully rated for extended use in outer space, but some wardens consider the lack of thermal insulation a feature.
ent-ClothingOuterHardsuitAncientEVA = NTSRA 無效訴訟
    .desc = 一款由中央司令部（CentCom）轄下NTSRA分部設計的古早款太空服。其工藝極為精湛，活動靈活性甚至優於多數現代太空服。 | An ancient space suit, designed by the NTSRA branch of CentComm. It is very finely crafted, allowing for greater mobility than most modern space suits.
ent-ClothingOuterHardsuitVoidParamed = paramedic void suit
    .desc = A void suit made for paramedics.
ent-ClothingOuterChameleon = 背心 | vest
    .desc = 一件外層具橡膠質感且防水的厚背心。 | A thick vest with a rubbery, water-resistant shell.
    .suffix = Chameleon
ent-ClothingOuterSuitBomb = 防爆服 | bomb suit
    .desc = 一種專為抵禦炸彈產生的壓力及炸彈可能產生的任何碎片而設計的重型防護服。 | A heavy suit designed to withstand the pressure generated by a bomb and any fragments the bomb may produce.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitJanitorBomb = 清潔工用防爆服 | janitorial bomb suit
    .desc = 專為抵禦由化學物質反應所引發的爆炸而設計的重型防彈衣。 | Heavy body armor designed to withstand explosions formed from reactions between chemicals.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitFire = 防火服 | fire suit
    .desc = 一套有助於抵禦極端溫度危害的防護服。 | A suit that helps protect against hazardous temperatures.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitAtmosFire = atmos 防火服 | atmos fire suit
    .desc = 一款價格不菲的防火服，即使面對最致命的消防站火災也能提供防護。其設計即使穿著者被火焰籠罩，仍能提供保護。 | An expensive firesuit that protects against even the most deadly of station fires. Designed to protect even if the wearer is set aflame.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitRad = 防輻射服 | radiation suit
    .desc = 一套能防輻射的防護服。標籤上寫著：「含鉛成分。請勿吞食隔熱材料。」 | A suit that protects against radiation. The label reads, 'Made with lead. Please do not consume insulation.'
ent-ClothingOuterSuitSpaceNinja = 太空忍者服 | space ninja suit
    .desc = 這套黑色、技術先進且經控制論增強的戰甲，具備諸如隱形或瞬間移動等多種能力。 | This black technologically advanced, cybernetically-enhanced suit provides many abilities like invisibility or teleportation.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitChicken = 雞裝 | chicken suit
    .desc = 咯咯咯！ | Bok bok bok!
ent-ClothingOuterSuitShrineMaiden = 神女服裝 | shrine maiden outfit
    .desc = 真讓人想去對付幾隻麻煩的妖怪啊。 | Makes you want to go deal with some troublesome youkai.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitWitchRobes = 女巫長袍 | witch robes
    .desc = 魔法的關鍵就在於法術威力，ZE！ | Magic is all about the spell power, ZE!
ent-ClothingOuterSuitMonkey = 猴子裝 | monkey suit
    .desc = 一套看起來像靈長類動物的西裝。 | A suit that looks like a primate.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitIan = 伊恩套裝 | ian suit
    .desc = 誰是個好孩子呢？ | Who's a good boy?
ent-ClothingOuterSuitCarp = 鯉魚套裝 | carp suit
    .desc = 一套特殊的服裝，如果你視力不佳的話，穿上它就會讓你看起來就像一條太空鯉魚。 | A special suit that makes you look just like a space carp, if your eyesight is bad.
