ent-ClothingOuterWinterMusician = 音樂家的冬外套 | musician's winter coat
    .desc = 一件超大號、用塑膠黏土製成的太空燕尾服，穿上它，大家肯定會問：「你認得我嗎？」 | An oversized, plasticine space tuxedo that'll have people asking "do you know me?"
