ent-ClothingShoesBootsMagAdv = 進階型磁力靴 | advanced magboots
    .desc = 最先進的磁力靴，穿著時不會拖慢穿著者腳步。 | State-of-the-art magnetic boots that do not slow down their wearer.
ent-ClothingShoesBootsMagSci = { ent-ClothingShoesBootsMagBase }
    .desc = { ent-ClothingShoesBootsMagBase.desc }
ent-ClothingShoesBootsMagBlinding = 擁有驚人速度的魔靴 | magboots of blinding speed
    .desc = 像你這樣迷人的女孩穿上這些，肯定會格外迷人。 | These would look fetching on a fetcher like you.
ent-ClothingShoesBootsMagSyndie = 血紅色的魔靴 | blood-red magboots
    .desc = 這款靴子是根據 ERT 磁力靴逆向工程開發而來，具備強大的磁吸力與內建推進器，可容納 0.75 公升的氣體。 | Reverse-engineered from ERT magboots, they have a heavy magnetic pull and integrated thrusters. It can hold 0.75 L of gas.
ent-ClothingShoesBootsMagERT = ERT 防水靴 | ERT magboots
    .desc = 這是 Nanotrasen 緊急應變小組所使用的升級版磁力靴，具備強大的磁吸力，並內建推進器。其氣體容量為 0.75 公升。 | Upgraded magnetic boots utilized by Nanotrasen's Emergency Response Teams, they have a heavy magnetic pull and integrated thrusters. It can hold 0.75 L of gas.
ent-ActionToggleMagboots = 切換 Magboots | Toggle Magboots
    .desc = 切換磁力靴的開啟與關閉狀態。 | Toggles the magboots on and off.
ent-ClothingShoesFlippers = 蹼 | flippers
    .desc = 一雙橡膠蛙鞋，穿上後能提升游泳能力。 | A pair of rubber flippers that improves swimming ability when worn.
ent-ClothingShoesLeather = 皮鞋 | leather shoes
    .desc = 這雙靴子非常時尚，採用上等皮革製成。 | Very stylish pair of boots, made from fine leather.
ent-ClothingShoesSlippers = 拖鞋 | slippers
    .desc = 好蓬鬆！ | Fluffy!
ent-ClothingShoeSlippersDuck = 小鴨拖鞋 | ducky slippers
    .desc = 你真希望這些東西在你走路時能發出「嘎嘎」的叫聲。不過，好在它們沒有這樣做。 | You wish these made quacking sounds as you walked. It's a good thing they don't, though.
ent-ClothingShoeSlippersLizard = 蜥蜴絨毛拖鞋 | lizard plushie slippers
    .desc = 一雙造型可愛、酷似蜥蜴人的拖鞋。搭配其他綠色服裝，你就會成為太空站上最酷的船員！ | An adorable pair of slippers that resemble a lizardperson. Combine this with some other green clothing and you'll be the coolest crewmember on the station!
ent-ClothingShoesTourist = 旅遊鞋 | tourist shoes
    .desc = 這雙便宜的涼鞋看起來不太舒服。 | These cheap sandals don't look very comfortable.
ent-ClothingShoesDameDane = 黑道鞋 | yakuza shoes
    .desc = 總算…… | At last...
ent-ClothingShoesSnakeskinBoots = 蛇皮靴 | snakeskin boots
    .desc = 這雙由曾經極為珍貴的蛇皮製成的靴子，周遭的人肯定都會羨慕不已。 | Boots made of once-valuable snakeskin, everyone around you would have been jealous.
ent-ClothingShoesBootsSpeed = 速度靴 | speed boots
    .desc = 採用量子纖維編織而成的高科技靴子，能夠將電力轉化為純粹的速度！ | High-tech boots woven with quantum fibers, able to convert electricity into pure speed!
ent-ActionToggleSpeedBoots = Toggle Speed 雪靴 | Toggle Speed Boots
    .desc = 開啟或關閉速度靴。 | Toggles the speed boots on and off.
ent-ClothingShoesBootsMoon = 月亮靴 | moon boots
    .desc = 採用特殊配方混合月球岩石凝膠所研發的特殊抗重力靴。從荷蘭寄出。 | Special anti-gravity boots developed with a speciality blend of lunar rock gel. Shipped from the Netherlands.
ent-ClothingShoesBootsJump = 跳躍靴 | jump boots
    .desc = 這雙高科技靴子能賦予你驚人的跳躍能力！穿上這雙靴子，你就能跳過熔岩、深淵，以及地面上的各種奇怪化學物質！ | High-tech boots that give you the incredible ability to JUMP! With these boots you can jump over lava, chasms and weird chemicals on the floor!
ent-ClothingShoesChef = 廚師鞋 | chef shoes
    .desc = 堅固的鞋子，能將墜落物或刀具造成的傷害降至最低。 | Sturdy shoes that minimize injury from falling objects or knives.
ent-ClothingShoesClownBase = { ent-ClothingShoesBaseButcherable }
    .desc = { ent-ClothingShoesBaseButcherable.desc }
ent-ClothingShoesClown = 小丑鞋 | clown shoes
    .desc = 惡作劇者標配的小丑鞋。天啊，這鞋也太大了吧！ | The prankster's standard-issue clowning shoes. Damn they're huge!
ent-ClothingShoesClownBanana = 香蕉小丑鞋 | banana clown shoes
    .desc = 當幽默與鞋履結合，便能將荒謬感提升至全新境界。 | When humor and footwear combine into new levels of absurdity.
ent-ClothingShoesBling = 閃亮小丑鞋 | bling clown shoes
    .desc = 採用精煉的香蕉礦製成，並以新鮮香蕉皮的果肉拋光。這些飾品展現出耀眼奪目的風采。 | Made of refined bananium and shined with the pulp of a fresh banana peel. These make a flashy statement.
ent-ClothingShoesCult = 經典鞋款 | cult shoes
    .desc = 一雙由納爾西（Nar'Sie）追隨者所穿的靴子。 | A pair of boots worn by the followers of Nar'Sie.
ent-ClothingShoesGaloshes = 雨鞋 | galoshes
    .desc = 專為降低清潔人員工作場所事故而設計的防滑橡膠靴；是清潔人員的寶貝。 | Specialised non-slip rubber boots, designed to reduce janitorial workplace accidents; a tider's treasure.
ent-ClothingShoesSpaceNinja = 太空忍者鞋 | space ninja shoes
    .desc = 一雙配備內建磁性吸盤的奈米強化靴。 | A pair of nano-enhanced boots with built-in magnetic suction cups.
ent-ClothingShoesSwat = 特警鞋 | swat shoes
    .desc = 當你想讓氣氛更熱絡時。 | When you want to turn up the heat.
ent-ClothingShoesWizard = 巫師鞋 | wizard shoes
    .desc = 一雙魔法鞋。 | A pair of magic shoes.
ent-ClothingShoesChameleon = 黑色鞋子 | black shoes
