ent-ClothingShoesCluwne = cluwne 鞋款 | cluwne shoes
    .desc = 這雙該死的克盧恩鞋。 | Cursed pair of cluwne shoes.
    .suffix = Unremoveable
ent-ClothingShoesClownLarge = 大號小丑鞋 | large clown shoes
    .desc = 當你需要在一群小丑之中脫穎而出時！ | When you need to stand out in a room full of clowns!
ent-ClothingShoesSkates = 直排輪 | roller skates
    .desc = 快點動起來吧！ | Get your skates on!
ent-ClothingUnderSocksBee = 蜜蜂襪 | bee socks
