ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitCaptain = 船長連身工作服 | captain's jumpsuit
    .desc = 這是一件藍色連身工作服，上面有些金色標記，標示著「上尉」的軍銜。 | It's a blue jumpsuit with some gold markings denoting the rank of "Captain".
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitHoP = 人事主管的連身工作服 | head of personnel's jumpsuit
    .desc = 相當平淡無奇，也不惹人厭。簡直是從宇宙中消失的絕佳選擇。 | Rather bland and inoffensive. Perfect for vanishing off the face of the universe.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitCommandGeneric = 指揮連身服 | command jumpsuit
    .desc = 一套通用款的「Command」色連身工作服，未隸屬於任何特定部門。 | A generic Command-colored jumpsuit not associated with any particular department.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitNanotrasen = nanotrasen 連身衣 | nanotrasen jumpsuit
    .desc = 一套莊重的藍色連身工作服，用以代表 NanoTrasen。 | A stately blue jumpsuit to represent NanoTrasen.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitCapFormal = 船長的正式西裝 | captain's formal suit
    .desc = 一套適合特殊場合的西裝。 | A suit for special occasions.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitChiefEngineer = 總工程師的工作服 | chief engineer's jumpsuit
    .desc = 這是一套高可見度連身工作服，專門頒發給那些瘋狂到足以晉升為首席工程師的工程師。 | It's a high visibility jumpsuit given to those engineers insane enough to achieve the rank of Chief Engineer.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitChiefEngineerTurtle = 總工程師的高領毛衣 | chief engineer's turtleneck
    .desc = 一款專為工程部門工作環境設計的黃色高領衫。 | A yellow turtleneck designed specifically for work in conditions of the engineering department.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitEngineering = 工程連身工作服 | engineering jumpsuit
    .desc = 如果這套防護服不導電的話，說不定工程師們真的會好好做他們該做的事。 | If this suit was non-conductive, maybe engineers would actually do their damn job.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitEngineeringHazard = 防護連身衣 | hazard jumpsuit
    .desc = 採用略帶粗獷感的溫暖橘色織造而成。讓周遭的人知道，在工作上你可是認真的。 | Woven in a grungy, warm orange. Lets others around you know that you really mean business when it comes to work.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitAtmos = 大氣技術人員連身工作服 | atmospheric technician jumpsuit
    .desc = 我正在上班。我不能離開工作崗位。工作就是我的呼吸。我正在檢測空氣品質。 | I am at work. I can't leave work. Work is breathing. I am testing air quality.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitAtmosCasual = 大氣技術人員的休閒連身工作服 | atmospheric technician's casual jumpsuit
    .desc = 既然你的工作這麼輕鬆，不如放鬆一下吧。 | Might as well relax with a job as easy as yours.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitSeniorEngineer = 資深工程師連身工作服 | senior engineer jumpsuit
    .desc = 工程部門內展現技術實力與聲望的象徵。 | A sign of skill and prestige within the engineering department.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitChemistry = 化學實驗連身衣 | chemistry jumpsuit
    .desc = 這件連身褲上有幾處奇怪的污漬。嗯。 | There's some odd stains on this jumpsuit. Hm.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitVirology = 病毒學防護服 | virology jumpsuit
    .desc = 它採用一種特殊纖維製成，能提供針對生物危害的特殊防護。上面還繡有病毒學家級別的肩章。 | It's made of a special fiber that gives special protection against biohazards. It has a virologist rank stripe on it.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitGenetics = 遺傳學連身衣 | genetics jumpsuit
    .desc = 它由一種特殊纖維製成，能提供針對生物危害的特殊防護。上面繡有遺傳學家級別的肩章。 | It's made of a special fiber that gives special protection against biohazards. It has a geneticist rank stripe on it.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitCMO = 醫務總管的連身工作服 | chief medical officer's jumpsuit
    .desc = 這是一套由具備擔任醫務總管資歷的人員所穿著的連身工作服，能提供基本的生物防護。 | It's a jumpsuit worn by those with the experience to be Chief Medical Officer. It provides minor biological protection.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitCMOTurtle = 醫務總管的高領連身工作服 | chief medical officer's turtleneck jumpsuit
    .desc = 這是一件由具備擔任醫務總管資歷的人士所穿的高領衫。它能提供輕微的生物防護。 | It's a turtleneck worn by those with the experience to be Chief Medical Officer. It provides minor biological protection.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitMedicalDoctor = 醫師連身工作服 | medical doctor jumpsuit
    .desc = 它由一種特殊纖維製成，能提供輕微的生物危害防護。胸前繡有十字標誌，表示穿著者是受過訓練的醫護人員。 | It's made of a special fiber that provides minor protection against biohazards. It has a cross on the chest denoting that the wearer is trained medical personnel.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitParamedic = 救護員連身工作服 | paramedic jumpsuit
    .desc = 上面標有「＋」，這應該是好事吧？ | It's got a plus on it, that's a good thing right?
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitSeniorPhysician = 資深醫師連身工作服 | senior physician jumpsuit
    .desc = 這是醫學界中展現專業能力與聲望的象徵。 | A sign of skill and prestige within the medical department.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitResearchDirector = 科學主任的高領衫 | research director's turtleneck
    .desc = 這是一件高領衫，專為那些具備勝任研究總監職位所需專業知識的人士所穿。其布料能提供輕微的防護，抵禦生物污染物。 | It's a turtleneck worn by those with the know-how to achieve the position of Research Director. Its fabric provides minor protection from biological contaminants.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitScientist = 科學家連身工作服 | scientist jumpsuit
    .desc = 它由一種特殊纖維製成，能提升他人對穿戴者的智商印象，同時削弱其個人道德觀。上面印有標誌，表明穿戴者是一名科學家。 | It's made of a special fiber that increases perceived intelligence and decreases personal ethics. It has markings that denote the wearer as a scientist.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitScientistFormal = 科學家的正式連身工作服 | scientist's formal jumpsuit
    .desc = 一款專為優雅科學家設計的制服，最適合搭配同款領帶穿著。 | A uniform for sophisticated scientists, best worn with its matching tie.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitRoboticist = 機器人工程師連身工作服 | roboticist jumpsuit
    .desc = 這是一款修身款的黑色工作服，縫線經過加固處理；非常適合從事工業工作。 | It's a slimming black with reinforced seams; great for industrial work.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitSeniorResearcher = 資深科學家連身工作服 | senior researcher jumpsuit
    .desc = 這是科學系內展現專業能力與聲望的象徵。 | A sign of skill and prestige within the science department.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitDetective = 穿得破舊的西裝 | hard-worn suit
    .desc = 穿這件衣服的人，可是認真的。 | Someone who wears this means business.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitDetectiveGrey = 黑色西裝 | noir suit
    .desc = 一位硬派私家偵探的灰色西裝，配有領帶夾。 | A hard-boiled private investigator's grey suit, complete with tie clip.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitHoS = 安保主管的連身工作服 | head of security's jumpsuit
    .desc = 它呈鮮紅色，質地相當爽脆，這點與安全人員的受害者通常的模樣頗為相似。 | It's bright red and rather crisp, much like security's victims tend to be.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitHoSAlt = 安保主管的高領衫 | head of security's turtleneck
    .desc = 這是一件高領衫，只有那些足夠強悍且紀律嚴明、足以晉升為安全主管的人才會穿。 | It's a turtleneck worn by those strong and disciplined enough to achieve the position of Head of Security.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitHoSBlue = 安保主管的藍色連身工作服 | head of security's blue jumpsuit
    .desc = 安全主管的一套藍色連身工作服。 | A blue jumpsuit of Head of Security.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitHoSGrey = 安保主管的灰色連身工作服 | head of security's grey jumpsuit
    .desc = 安全主管身穿一套灰色的連身工作服，這讓他看起來有點像乘客。 | A grey jumpsuit of Head of Security, which make him look somewhat like a passenger.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitHoSParadeMale = 安全主管的閱兵禮服 | head of security's parade uniform
    .desc = 一名男性安保主管在特殊場合穿著的奢華服飾。 | A male head of security's luxury-wear, for special occasions.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitBrigmedic = 軍用醫療連身衣 | brigmedic jumpsuit
    .desc = 這套制服是發放給已受過訓練且符合資格的人員。沒人在乎那場訓練只花了半天時間。 | This uniform is issued to qualified personnel who have been trained. No one cares that the training took half a day.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitPrisoner = 囚犯連身服 | prisoner jumpsuit
    .desc = 一套供囚犯穿著的連身衣。其內建的感測器會隨時自動啟用。 | A jumpsuit used for prisoners. It has suit sensors automatically enabled at all times.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitSec = 安全連身工作服 | security jumpsuit
    .desc = 這款連身工作服採用堅韌材質製成，能提供強效防護。 | A jumpsuit made of strong material, providing robust protection.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitSecBlue = 藍色襯衫和領帶 | blue shirt and tie
    .desc = 卡爾霍恩，我現在有點忙。 | I'm a little busy right now, Calhoun.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitSecGrey = 灰色防暴連身工作服 | grey security jumpsuit
    .desc = 這是過去某個時期的戰術神器，那時 NanoTrasen 尚未決定，將防護服染成紅色比清洗掉血跡更划算。 | A tactical relic of years past before Nanotrasen decided it was cheaper to dye the suits red instead of washing out the blood.
ent-ClothingUniformSecurityTrooper = 騎警制服 | trooper uniform
    .desc = 發給 NanoTrasen 突擊隊員的正式制服，通常會配有一輛車。 | A formal uniform issued to the Nanotrasen Troopers, usually it comes with a car.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitWarden = 獄警制服 | warden's uniform
    .desc = 一套配備 Nanotrasen 皮帶扣的正式警用制服。 | A formal security suit for officers complete with Nanotrasen belt buckle.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitHosFormal = 霍斯的正式西裝 | hos's formal suit
    .desc = 一套適合特殊場合的西裝。 | A suit for special occasions.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitSeniorOfficer = 高級警官連身制服 | senior officer jumpsuit
    .desc = 這是保安部門內展現專業能力與聲望的象徵。 | A sign of skill and prestige within the security department.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitBartender = 調酒師制服 | bartender's uniform
    .desc = 這身制服很整潔美觀。不過那條橫條就讓人有點遺憾了。 | A nice and tidy uniform. Shame about the bar though.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitJacketMonkey = 調酒師的猴子夾克 | bartender's monkey jacket
    .desc = 一件像樣的外套，給一隻像樣的猴子。 | A decent jacket, for a decent monkey.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitBartenderPurple = 紫色的調酒師制服 | purple bartender's uniform
    .desc = 一套專門用來端飲料的紫色服裝。 | A special purple outfit to serve drinks.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitChaplain = 軍牧的連身工作服 | chaplain's jumpsuit
    .desc = 這是一件黑色的連身衣，常被宗教人士穿著。 | It's a black jumpsuit, often worn by religious folk.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitChef = 廚師制服 | chef uniform
    .desc = 沒有這個就做不了菜。 | Can't cook without this.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitClown = 小丑服 | clown suit
    .desc = 嗶——！ | HONK!
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitClownBanana = 香蕉小丑服 | banana clown suit
    .desc = { ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitClown.desc }
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitJester = 小丑服 | jester suit
    .desc = 這件俏皮的洋裝，非常適合用來款待你的主人，叔公。 | A jolly dress, well suited to entertain your master, nuncle.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitJesterAlt = { ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitJester }
    .desc = { ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitJester.desc }
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitHydroponics = 水耕栽培連身工作服 | hydroponics jumpsuit
    .desc = 散發出一股濃烈的泥土味。希望這只是髒了，而不是被弄髒了。 | Has a strong earthy smell to it. Hopefully it's merely dirty as opposed to soiled.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitJanitor = 清潔工連身工作服 | janitor jumpsuit
    .desc = 那件給拿著拖把的可憐蟲穿的連身工作服。 | The jumpsuit for the poor sop with a mop.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitMime = MIME 套裝 | mime suit
    .desc = ... | ...
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitLibrarian = 圖書館員連身工作服 | librarian jumpsuit
    .desc = 一件舒適的綠色毛衣，非常適合一位圖書策展人。 | A cosy green jumper fit for a curator of books.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitCurator = 得體的西裝 | sensible suit
    .desc = 這很明智。實在太明智了…… | It's sensible. Too sensible...
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitPsychologist = 心理學家西裝 | psychologist suit
    .desc = 我不會弄丟東西。只是把東西放在某些地方，後來卻想不起來放在哪裡了。 | I don't lose things. I place things in locations which later elude me.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitTramDriver = 電車司機連身工作服 | tram driver jumpsuit
    .desc = 熨燙得完美無瑕，專為準備周全的專業人士而設。 | Perfectly ironed, for well-prepared professionals.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitReporter = 記者套裝 | reporter suit
    .desc = 一位優秀的記者，終其一生都會保持懷疑精神。 | A good reporter remains a skeptic all their life.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitSafari = 薩法里套裝 | safari suit
    .desc = 非常適合進行叢林探險。 | Perfect for a jungle excursion.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitJournalist = 記者套裝 | journalist suit
    .desc = 如果新聞報導是優質的，那麼它本質上就是具爭議性的。 | If journalism is good, it is controversial, by nature.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitMonasticRobeDark = 深色的修道袍 | dark monastic robe
    .desc = 這是一件深色的長袍，通常由宗教人士穿著。 | It's a dark robe, often worn by religious folk.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitMonasticRobeLight = 淺色僧袍 | light monastic robe
    .desc = 這是一件輕便的長袍，通常由宗教人士穿著。 | It's a light robe, often worn by religious folk.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitMusician = 音樂家的晚禮服 | musician's tuxedo
    .desc = 一款專為音樂愛好者設計的華麗燕尾服。非常適合任何酒廊演出！ | A fancy tuxedo for the musically inclined.  Perfect for any lounge act!
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitCluwne = 克盧恩套裝 | cluwne suit
    .desc = 這該死的小丑服。 | Cursed cluwne suit.
    .suffix = Unremoveable
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitLawyerRed = 紅色律師西裝 | red lawyer suit
    .desc = 一種由律師和愛出風頭的人穿著的、花俏的紅色西裝。 | A flashy red suit worn by lawyers and show-offs.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitLawyerBlue = 藍色律師西裝 | blue lawyer suit
    .desc = 一種由律師和愛出風頭的人穿著的、花俏的藍色西裝。 | A flashy blue suit worn by lawyers and show-offs.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitLawyerBlack = 黑色律師西裝 | black lawyer suit
    .desc = 一種低調的黑色西裝，既是律師也是黑幫分子所穿著的。 | A subtle black suit worn by lawyers and gangsters.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitLawyerPurple = 紫色律師西裝 | purple lawyer suit
    .desc = 一款時尚的紫色單品，深受律師與演藝界人士青睞。 | A stylish purple piece worn by lawyers and show people.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitLawyerGood = 一套像樣的律師西裝 | good lawyer's suit
    .desc = 一套俗氣的西裝，簡直是為犯罪辯護律師量身打造的！ | A tacky suit perfect for a CRIMINAL lawyer!
ent-ClothingUniformOveralls = 連身工作服 | overalls
    .desc = 非常適合在戶外工作。 | Great for working outdoors.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitRecruitNT = 新兵連身工作服 | recruit jumpsuit
    .desc = 一款配有藍色滾邊的優雅灰色連身工作服，非常適合氣質端莊的助手。 | A classy grey jumpsuit with blue trims. Perfect for the dignified helper.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitRecruitSyndie = 黑幫招募連身衣 | syndicate recruit jumpsuit
    .desc = 一套令人起疑的深灰色連身工作服。彷彿乘客們還不夠心存疑慮似的。 | A dubious, dark-grey jumpsuit. As if passengers weren't dubious enough already.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitRepairmanNT = 維修工連身工作服 | repairman jumpsuit
    .desc = 這件連身工作服會讓你聯想到某個船員部門的工作崗位。但願你不必像那些怪胎一樣做同樣的工作。 | A jumpsuit that reminds you of a certain crew-sector work position. Hopefully, you won't have to do the same job as THOSE freaks.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitRepairmanSyndie = 黑幫維修工連身工作服 | syndicate repairman jumpsuit
    .desc = 實用、時尚又酷勁十足。Nanotrasen 的工程師們都希望自己也能像這件單品一樣帥氣。 | Functional, fashionable, and badass. Nanotrasen's engineers wish they could look as good as this.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitParamedicSyndie = 「辛迪加」救護員連身工作服 | syndicate paramedic jumpsuit
    .desc = 不知為何，穿上這件衣服會讓人覺得自己似乎快要違反《日內瓦公約》了。 | For some reason, wearing this makes you feel like you're awfully close to violating the Geneva Convention.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitChiefEngineerSyndie = 辛迪加總工程師連身工作服 | syndicate chief engineer jumpsuit
    .desc = 一套看起來很邪惡的連身工作服，搭配反光背心和紅色背心。
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitPyjamaSyndicateBlack = 黑色黑手黨睡衣 | black syndicate pyjamas
    .desc = 獻給在 perma 度過的那些漫漫長夜。 | For those long nights in perma.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitPyjamaSyndicatePink = 粉紅幫睡衣 | pink syndicate pyjamas
    .desc = 獻給在 perma 度過的那些漫漫長夜。 | For those long nights in perma.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitPyjamaSyndicateRed = 紅色辛迪加睡衣 | red syndicate pyjamas
    .desc = 獻給在 perma 度過的那些漫漫長夜。 | For those long nights in perma.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitOperative = 特勤連身衣 | operative jumpsuit
    .desc = 專為在深空執行戰術行動的精英組織特工設計的制服。 | Uniform for elite syndicate operatives performing tactical operations in deep space.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitTacticool = 戰術風連身服 | tacticool jumpsuit
    .desc = 專為在深空執行「戰術絕緣手套竊盜」任務、表現平平的實境扮演者（LARPer）所設計的制服。 | Uniform for subpar operative LARPers performing tactical insulated glove theft in deep space.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitMercenary = 傭兵連身服 | mercenary jumpsuit
    .desc = 專為真正的傭兵設計的服裝，他們曾歷經火海、水域，以及充斥著危險怪獸或懸賞目標的星球叢林。 | Clothing for real mercenaries who have gone through fire, water and the jungle of planets flooded with dangerous monsters or targets for which a reward has been assigned.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitNinja = 忍者連身服 | ninja jumpsuit
    .desc = 舒適的忍者服，無論是放鬆時還是需要練習時，都能讓您穿著自如。 | Comfortable ninja suit, for convenience when relaxing and when you need to practice.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitPirate = 海盜的殘羹剩飯 | pirate slops
    .desc = 一款以太空水手連身衣為藍本的海盜風變體款式。 | A pirate variation of a space sailor's jumpsuit.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitSyndieFormal = 辛特加幫正式西裝 | syndicate formal suit
    .desc = 該組織的制服設計優雅，穿著這身制服去搞些骯髒把戲，實在有些可惜。 | The syndicate's uniform is made in an elegant style, it's even a pity to do dirty tricks in this.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitWeb = 網眼連身褲 | web jumpsuit
    .desc = 這清楚地表明，你與蛛網合而為一。 | Makes it clear that you are one with the webs.
ent-UniformShortsRed = 拳擊短褲 | boxing shorts
    .desc = 這些是短褲，不是平角褲。 | These are shorts, not boxers.
ent-UniformShortsRedWithTop = 附上衣的拳擊短褲 | boxing shorts with top
    .desc = 這些是短褲，不是平角褲。 | These are shorts, not boxers.
ent-ClothingUniformRandom = { ent-ClothingUniformBase }
    .desc = 由神經網路根據最新時尚趨勢生成。 | Generated by neural networks based on the latest fashion trends.
    .suffix = Random visual
ent-ClothingRandomSpawner = 隨機的彩色服裝 | random colorful costume
    .desc = { ent-ClothingUniformRandom.desc }
    .suffix = { ent-ClothingUniformRandom.suffix }
