ent-DeviceQuantumSpinInverter = 量子自旋反轉器 | quantum spin inverter
    .desc = 一種實驗性裝置，能夠透過切換兩個實體的粒子自旋值，來交換兩者的位置。必須與另一台裝置連結才能運作。 | An experimental device that is able to swap the locations of two entities by switching their particles' spin values. Must be linked to another device to function.
ent-CameraBug = 相機錯誤 | camera bug
    .desc = 一種辛迪加所研發的裝置，可讓您駭入該電台的攝影機網路。 | An illegal syndicate device that allows you to hack into the station's camera network.
ent-WeaponPistolCHIMPUpgradeKit = C.H.I.M.P. 手炮升級晶片 | C.H.I.M.P. handcannon upgrade chip
    .desc = 一款適用於 C.H.I.M.P. 的實驗性升級套件 | An experimental upgrade kit for the C.H.I.M.P.
ent-DnaInjectorUnlimited = DNA 注入器 | DNA injector
    .desc = 可用於從某人身上提取 DNA 樣本，並將其注入另一人體內，使其成為原人的克隆體。 | Can be used to take a DNA sample from someone and inject it into another person, turning them into a clone of the original.
    .suffix = Admeme, unlimited
ent-DnaInjector = { ent-DnaInjectorUnlimited }
    .desc = { ent-DnaInjectorUnlimited.desc }
    .suffix = Admeme, single use
ent-HoloparasiteInjector = 全息寄生體注射器 | holoparasite injector
    .desc = 一件由手持裝置組成的複雜藝術品，讓使用者能夠寄宿一名全息寄生守護者。 | A complex artwork of handheld machinery allowing the user to host a holoparasite guardian.
ent-HoloClownInjector = 全息小丑注射器 | holoclown injector
    .desc = 一件由手持機械組成的複雜藝術品，讓使用者能夠收養一名全息小丑守護者。 | A complex artwork of handheld machinery allowing the user to host a holoclown guardian.
ent-GuardianDeck = 守護者牌組 | guardian deck
    .desc = 一副守護者塔羅牌，能夠將一位個人守護者與你的身體綁定。 | A deck of guardian tarot cards, capable of binding a personal guardian to your body.
ent-BoxHoloparasite = 全息寄生盒 | holoparasite box
    .desc = 一個裝有全息寄生蟲注射器的盒子。 | A box containing a holoparasite injector.
ent-BoxHoloclown = 全息小丑盒 | holoclown box
    .desc = 一個裝有全息小丑注射器的盒子。 | A box containing a holoclown injector.
ent-ReinforcementRadio = 辛迪加強化無線電 | syndicate reinforcement radio
    .desc = 立刻找一位來路不明的合夥特工！僅提供基本設備。 | Call in a syndicate agent of questionable quality, instantly! Only basic equipment provided.
ent-ReinforcementRadioSyndicate = 辛迪加強化無線電 | syndicate reinforcement radio
    .desc = 立刻請一位來歷可疑的辛迪加特工前來！ | Call in a syndicate agent of questionable quality, instantly!
ent-ReinforcementRadioSyndicateNukeops = 核武特工無線電 | nuclear operative radio
    .desc = 立刻召喚一名實力成疑的核武特工！基本核武特工裝備已備妥。 | Call in a nuclear operative of questionable quality, instantly! Basic nukeop equipment provided.
    .suffix = NukeOps
ent-ReinforcementRadioSyndicateAncestor = 辛迪加遺傳祖先強化電台 | syndicate genetic ancestor reinforcement radio
    .desc = 召喚一位由您親自挑選、經過特別訓練的祖先前來協助您。 | Calls in a specially trained ancestor of your choosing to assist you.
ent-ReinforcementRadioSyndicateAncestorNukeops = { ent-ReinforcementRadioSyndicateAncestor }
    .desc = { ent-ReinforcementRadioSyndicateAncestor.desc }
    .suffix = NukeOps
ent-ReinforcementRadioSyndicateSyndiCat = 工會 加強 無線電 | syndicat reinforcement radio
    .desc = 召喚一隻受過嚴格訓練、攜帶微型炸彈的貓來協助你。 | Calls in a faithfully trained cat with a microbomb to assist you.
ent-ReinforcementRadioSyndicateCyborgAssault = 辛迪加 突擊 賽博格 增援 無線電 | syndicate assault cyborg reinforcement radio
    .desc = 立刻調派一名武裝精良的突擊賽博格！ | Call in a well armed assault cyborg, instantly!
    .suffix = NukeOps
ent-SingularityBeacon = 奇點信標 | singularity beacon
    .desc = 一種能吸引奇點的聯合裝置。如果它鬆脫了，而你正看到這段訊息，請立刻逃跑。 | A syndicate device that attracts the singularity. If it's loose and you're seeing this, run.
ent-NukeOpsDeclarationOfWar = 宣戰者 | war declarator
    .desc = 用於向目標發出宣戰書，藉此延遲你的穿梭機起飛時間，讓對方有時間為你的襲擊做準備。如此大膽的舉動將吸引「辛迪加」內強大金主們的注意，他們將為你的團隊提供大量額外的電晶幣。必須在任務開始時使用，否則你的金主們將會失去興趣。 | Use to send a declaration of hostilities to the target, delaying your shuttle departure while they prepare for your assault. Such a brazen move will attract the attention of powerful benefactors within the Syndicate, who will supply your team with a massive amount of bonus telecrystals. Must be used at start of mission, or your benefactors will lose interest.
ent-TeleporterChipBlank = 傳送器晶片 | teleporter chip
    .desc = 一款可儲存傳送門座標的晶片。將其插入傳送門控制主控台，即可控制連結的傳送門。 | A chip that can store teleporter coordinates. Insert it into the teleporter control console to be able to control the linked portal.
    .suffix = Blank
ent-TravelCamera = 旅遊相機 | travel camera
    .desc = 一圖勝千言。配備超亮閃光燈及內建可充電式攝影捲軸。 | A picture says more than a thousand words. Comes with an ultrabright flash and internal recharging photo roll.
