ent-BorgModuleAdvancedClowning = 進階小丑賽博格模組 | advanced clowning cyborg module
    .desc = 專為最傻氣的賽博格設計的進階服務模組！內建烤箱，可隨時間自動烘烤派餅；另附全息剝皮投影機與按鈕式喇叭。 | Advanced service module for only the silliest cyborgs! Comes with a built-in oven that bakes pies automatically over time, a holopeel projector, and a push horn.
ent-BorgModuleSyndicateWeapon = 武器用賽博格模組 | weapon cyborg module
    .desc = { ent-BaseBorgModule.desc }
ent-BorgModuleOperative = 作戰型賽博格模組 | operative cyborg module
    .desc = 一套包含撬棍、Emag、Access Breaker 以及 辛迪加 定位器的模組。 | A module that comes with a crowbar, an Emag, an Access Breaker and a syndicate pinpointer.
ent-BorgModuleEsword = 能量劍賽博格模組 | energy sword cyborg module
    .desc = 一款附帶能量劍的武器模組。 | A weapons module that comes with an energy sword.
ent-BorgModuleDoubleEsword = 雙能量劍賽博格模組 | double energy sword cyborg module
    .desc = 一款配備雙能量劍的武器模組。 | A weapons module that comes with a double energy sword.
ent-BorgModuleL6C = L6C ROW 賽博格模組 | L6C ROW cyborg module
    .desc = L6C 隨附的一款武器模組。 | A weapons module that comes with a L6C.
ent-BorgModuleC20r = C-20r ROW 賽博格模組 | C-20r ROW cyborg module
    .desc = 一款配備連發式 C-20r 的武器模組。 | A weapons module that comes with a burst-fire C-20r.
ent-BorgModuleMartyr = 殉道者賽博格模組 | martyr cyborg module
    .desc = 這是一個附帶爆炸物的模組，你大概不希望自己動手處理。 | A module that comes with an explosive you probably don't want to handle yourself.
ent-MothershipModule = 母艦模組 | mothership module
    .desc = 一個有助於母艦博格大腦運作，並協助安裝其他模組的模組。 | A module that helps the mothership borg brains and install other modules.
ent-XenoborgModuleBasic = 基本異種機器人模組 | basic xenoborg module
    .desc = 每位異種博格必備的物品。 | Essential items for any Xenoborg.
ent-XenoborgModuleTool = 工具 xenoborg 模組 | tool xenoborg module
    .desc = 適用於大多數異種博格的簡易工具。 | Simple tools for most Xenoborgs.
ent-XenoborgModuleAdvancedTool = 進階工具：Xenoborg 模組 | advanced tool xenoborg module
    .desc = 內含先進異種博格技術的高階工程模組。 | Advanced engineering module containing advanced xenoborg technology.
ent-XenoborgModuleAccessBreaker = 存取斷路器 異種博格模組 | access breaker xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備斷路器的模組。 | Module with an access breaker.
ent-XenoborgModuleConstruction = 建造外星博格模組 | construction xenoborg module
    .desc = { ent-BaseXenoborgModuleEngi.desc }
ent-XenoborgModuleDeflectorField = 偏轉場外星博格模組 | deflector field xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備自充電偏轉場投射器的模組。 | Module with a self-recharging deflector field projector.
ent-XenoborgModuleDoorControl = 門控外星生化人模組 | door control xenoborg module
    .desc = 讓異種博格能夠控制氣閘的模組。 | Module that allows Xenoborgs to control airlocks.
ent-XenoborgModuleTileGun = 磁磚槍 異種博格模組 | tile gun xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備瓷磚槍的模組。等等，那是什麼？ | Module with a tile gun. wait, a what?
ent-XenoborgModuleZap = 摧毀異種博格模組 | zap xenoborg module
    .desc = 此模組可使異種博格失去接地功能，使其帶電。真是令人震驚！ | Module that disables the grounding of the xenoborg, making them electrified. Shocking!
ent-XenoborgModuleOilGun = 油槍外星博格模組 | oil gun xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備一挺可發射裝有易燃油安瓿的槍械的模組。 | Module with a gun that shoots ampoules filled with flammable oil.
ent-XenoborgModuleNaniteGun = 奈米機器人槍 異種博格模組 | nanite gun xenoborg module
    .desc = 此模組可讓異種博格配備一款能發射水晶的奈米機器人槍。 | Module that allows Xenoborgs to have a crystal firing nanite gun.
ent-XenoborgModuleJammer = 干擾器外星機器人模組 | jammer xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備通訊干擾器的模組。 | Module with a communication jammer.
ent-XenoborgModuleLaser = 雷射外星人模組 | laser xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備雷射槍的模組。 | Module with a laser gun.
ent-XenoborgModuleHeavyLaser = 雷射砲外星博格模組 | laser cannon xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備雷射砲的模組。 | Module with a laser cannon.
ent-XenoborgModuleGuidedMissileLauncher = 導彈發射器 異種機器人模組 | guided missile launcher xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備導引飛彈發射器及測距儀的模組，用於鎖定目標。 | Module with guided missile launcher and a range finder to set targets.
ent-XenoborgModuleRocket = 火箭模組 | rocket module
    .desc = 一個配備火箭發射器的模組，專門用於摧毀建築物。 | A module with a rocket launcher designed to destroy structures.
ent-XenoborgModuleBurstFireLaser = 連發雷射外星博格模組 | burst fire laser xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備連發燃燒型雷射的模組。 | Module with a burst fire incendiary laser.
ent-XenoborgModuleHeavyRadioactive = 放射性外星博格模組 | radioactive xenoborg module
    .desc = 使異種博格散發出輻射能的模組。 | Module that causes a xenoborg to emanate radioactive energy.
ent-XenoborgModuleSpaceMovement = 太空行動 異種博格模組 | space movement xenoborg module
    .desc = 一個能協助外星機器人在太空中更靈活移動的模組。 | Module that helps a Xenoborg move better in space.
ent-XenoborgModuleJump = 外星機器人跳躍模組 | xenoborg jump module
    .desc = 可讓異種博格向前跳躍的模組。 | Module that allows a xenoborg to jump forward.
ent-XenoborgModuleSword = 刀型異種博格模組 | knife xenoborg module
    .desc = 附有庫克里刀的模組。 | Module with a kukri knife.
ent-XenoborgModuleEnergySword = 能量匕首外星博格模組 | energy dagger xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備能量匕首的模組。 | Module with an energy dagger.
ent-XenoborgModuleBioKinfe = 生物刀異種博格模組 | bio knife xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備生物刀的模組。 | Module with an bio knife.
ent-XenoborgModuleHypo = nocturine hypo xenoborg 模組 | nocturine hypo xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備自動補液功能之夜間排尿低血糖治療模組。 | Module with a self-refilling nocturine hypo.
ent-XenoborgModuleChameleonProjector = 變色龍投影機 異種機器人模組 | chameleon projector xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備變色龍投影機的模組。 | Module with a chameleon projector.
ent-XenoborgModuleCloakDevice = 隱形裝置 異種博格模組 | cloaking device xenoborg module
    .desc = 一個內建裝置的模組，可讓異種生化人短暫地處於半隱形狀態。 | Module with a device that allows xenoborgs to become semi-invisible for some time.
ent-XenoborgModuleSuperCloakDevice = 隱形裝置 異種博格模組 | invisibility device xenoborg module
    .desc = 一個內建裝置的模組，能讓異種生化人短暫地徹底隱形。 | Module with a device that allows xenoborgs to become truly invisible for a short amount of time.
ent-CyborgEndoskeleton = 賽博格內骨骼 | cyborg endoskeleton
    .desc = 這是打造賽博格的骨架。比預期的要不那麼駭人得多。 | A frame that cyborgs are built on. Significantly less spooky than expected.
ent-MMI = 人機介面 | man-machine interface
    .desc = 一種能夠促進生物大腦與電子設備之間溝通的裝置，使機組人員在遭遇工作相關事故後仍能持續發揮價值。 | A machine able to facilitate communication between a biological brain and electronics, enabling crew to continue to provide value after work-related incidents.
ent-MMIFilled = { ent-MMI }
    .desc = { ent-MMI.desc }
    .suffix = Filled
ent-PositronicBrain = 正電子大腦 | positronic brain
    .desc = 一種能夠產生自發性神經活動的人工大腦。 | An artificial brain capable of spontaneous neural activity.
ent-OreBag = 礦石袋 | ore bag
    .desc = 一款堅固耐用的背包，專為回收專家與礦工設計，用於搬運大量礦石。當繫在腰帶上時，會使附近的礦石磁化。 | A robust bag for salvage specialists and miners alike to carry large amounts of ore. Magnetises any nearby ores when attached to a belt.
ent-BorgOreBag = 一體式礦石袋 | integrated ore bag
    .desc = 一個嵌入採礦賽博格框架的大型礦石袋。拿在手中時，會使附近的礦石磁化。 | A large ore bag built into the frame of a mining cyborg. Magnetises any nearby ores when held.
ent-OreBagOfHolding = 礦石收納袋 | ore bag of holding
    .desc = 一款堅固的收納袋，無論是打撈億萬富翁還是富裕的礦工，都能用來攜帶大量礦石。當繫在腰帶上時，會使附近的礦石磁化。 | A robust bag of holding for salvage billionaires and rich miners alike to carry large amounts of ore. Magnetises any nearby ores when attached to a belt.
ent-BorgOreBagOfHolding = 整合型礦石收納袋 | integrated ore bag of holding
    .desc = 一個嵌入富礦型採礦賽博格框架中的超大礦石袋。持有時會將附近的所有礦石磁化。 | A very large ore bag built into the frame of a rich mining cyborg. Magnetises any nearby ores when held.
ent-MineralScannerUnpowered = 礦物掃描儀 | mineral scanner
    .desc = 一種用於檢測周圍岩石中是否有有用礦物的掃描器。必須握在手中或放在口袋裡才能運作。 | A scanner that checks surrounding rock for useful minerals. It must be in your hand or pocket to work.
    .suffix = Always Powered
ent-MineralScanner = { ent-MineralScannerUnpowered }
    .desc = { ent-MineralScannerUnpowered.desc }
ent-MineralScannerEmpty = { ent-MineralScanner }
    .desc = { ent-MineralScanner.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
ent-AdvancedMineralScannerUnpowered = 先進礦物掃描儀 | advanced mineral scanner
    .desc = 一款用於檢測周圍岩石中是否有有用礦物的掃描器。必須握在手中或放入口袋中才能運作。這款掃描器的偵測範圍較廣。 | A scanner that checks surrounding rock for useful minerals. It must be in your hand or pocket to work. This one has an extended range.
    .suffix = Always Powered
ent-AdvancedMineralScanner = { ent-AdvancedMineralScannerUnpowered }
    .desc = { ent-AdvancedMineralScannerUnpowered.desc }
ent-AdvancedMineralScannerEmpty = { ent-AdvancedMineralScanner }
    .desc = { ent-AdvancedMineralScanner.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
ent-DeployableBarrier = 可部署式屏障 | deployable barrier
    .desc = 一座可展開的柵欄。刷您的ID卡即可上鎖／解鎖。 | A deployable barrier. Swipe your ID card to lock/unlock it.
ent-EvidenceMarker = 證據標記 | evidence marker
    .desc = 一支帶有編號的黃色標記筆，可用於標示犯罪現場的證據。 | A numbered yellow marker, useful for labeling evidence on a crime scene.
ent-EvidenceMarkerOne = { ent-EvidenceMarker }
    .desc = { ent-EvidenceMarker.desc }
