ent-BaseWeaponLauncher = 基礎武器發射器 | BaseWeaponLauncher
    .desc = 一款超棒的隨拍相機。 | A rooty tooty point and shooty.
ent-WeaponLauncherChinaLake = 中國湖 | china lake
    .desc = 噗噗。 | PLOOP.
ent-WeaponLauncherHydra = 九頭蛇 | hydra
    .desc = 噗……嘶——…… | PLOOP... FSSSSSS...
ent-WeaponLauncherHydraLethal = { ent-WeaponLauncherHydra }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponLauncherHydra.desc }
    .suffix = frag
ent-WeaponLauncherRocket = RPG-7 | RPG-7
    .desc = 一款經過改裝的古早型火箭推進榴彈發射器。 | A modified ancient rocket-propelled grenade launcher.
ent-WeaponGuidedMissileLauncherXenoborg = XB GML-78
    .desc = 一枚導彈發射器。 | A guided missile launcher.
ent-WeaponLauncherMultipleRocket = 多管火箭發射器 | multiple rocket launcher
    .desc = 一款經過改裝的古早型火箭推進榴彈發射器。 | A modified ancient rocket-propelled grenade launcher.
ent-WeaponRocketLauncherXenoborg = XB MRL-97-D
    .desc = 一具配備特殊爆破火箭的外星火箭發射器。 | A alien rocket launcher fitted with special demolition rockets.
ent-WeaponLauncherPirateCannon = 海盜大砲 | pirate cannon
    .desc = 砰！ | Kaboom!
ent-WeaponGrapplingGun = 抓鉤槍 | grappling gun
    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
ent-WeaponLauncherAdmemeMeteorLarge = 流星發射器 | meteor launcher
    .desc = 它會發射大型隕石。 | It fires large meteors.
    .suffix = Admeme
ent-WeaponLauncherAdmemeImmovableRodSlow = 固定式彈桿發射器 | immovable rod launcher
    .desc = 它會發射緩慢且無法移動的長棒。 | It fires slow immovable rods.
    .suffix = Admeme
ent-BaseWeaponLightMachineGun = 基礎武器輕機槍 | BaseWeaponLightMachineGun
    .desc = 一款超棒的隨拍相機。 | A rooty tooty point and shooty.
ent-WeaponLightMachineGunL6 = L6 SAW | L6 SAW
    .desc = 由瓦夫爾公司（Waffle Corp）研發的 L6 小隊自動武器，是一款致命的輕機槍，常被戈萊克斯掠奪者（Gorlex Marauders）所使用。儘管體積龐大且笨重，但其厚重的槍管與大彈匣容量，使其能以密集的子彈雨完美壓制敵軍。採用 .30 口徑彈帶供彈。 | Developed by Waffle Corp, the L6 Squad Automatic Weapon is a deadly light machine gun often used by the Gorlex Marauders. Although bulky and cumbersome, its heavy barrel and high ammo capacity make it perfect for suppressing combatants with a hail of bullets. Feeds from .30 ammo belts.
ent-WeaponLightMachineGunL6C = L6C ROW | L6C ROW
    .desc = 一款供賽博格使用的 L6 SAW 機槍。透過內建的彈藥製造器，能即時製造 .30 口徑步槍彈藥，且該製造器會緩慢地自動充電。 | A L6 SAW for use by cyborgs. Creates .30 rifle ammo on the fly from an internal ammo fabricator, which slowly self-charges.
ent-WeaponNaniteGun = 奈米機器人槍 | nanite gun
    .desc = 一把奇特的槍，能射出封裝在水晶碎片中的奈米機器人，既能治癒博格人，卻會傷害那些血肉之軀的低等生物。 | A strange gun that shoots nanites encased in crystal shards that heals borgs but hurts fleshy inferior beings.
ent-WeaponOilGun = 油槍 | oil gun
    .desc = 這把槍會發射裝有異種博格油的安瓿，若直接命中有機體，會使其打滑或變得易燃。槍口還會噴出一縷微火，將其點燃！ | This gun launches ampoules of xenoborg oil to make organics slip or become flammable if hit with a direct hit. It comes with a tiny flame to light them on fire!
ent-BaseWeaponPistol = BasePistol | BasePistol
    .desc = 一款超棒的隨拍相機。 | A rooty tooty point and shooty.
ent-WeaponPistolViper = 蝰蛇 | viper
    .desc = 一款經「辛迪加」非法改裝的常見手槍。「蝰蛇」配備可切換半自動與「搖滾模式」的選擇開關，是所有隸屬於「三蛇」組織的士兵所配備的標準配槍，使用 .35 口徑手槍彈匣供彈。 | A common handgun illegally modified by the Syndicate. The Viper sports a selector switch between semi-auto and ‘rock and roll’. The standard sidearm for any soldier who fights under the three serpents. Feeds from .35 pistol magazines.
ent-WeaponPistolEchis = echis | echis
    .desc = 一款以「Viper」手槍為基礎的賽博格搭載武器系統。透過內建的製造器即時生成彈藥，並能緩慢地自行充電。 | A cyborg-mounted weapon system based on the Viper pistol. Creates ammunition on the fly from an internal fabricator, which slowly self-charges.
ent-WeaponPistolCobra = 眼镜蛇 | cobra
    .desc = 由「辛迪加」所使用的內建消音半自動手槍，發射無殼亞音速子彈。深受任何喜歡保持行動低調且不留任何證據的特工青睞。採用 .25 口徑手槍彈匣供彈。 | Integrally suppressed semi-automatic pistol used by the Syndicate, firing caseless subsonic rounds. Favored by any agent who likes to keep things quiet and leave no evidence behind. Feeds from .25 pistol magazines.
ent-WeaponPistolMk58 = mk 58 | mk 58
    .desc = Mk58 由 Nanotrasen 輕武器部門設計，是一款採用簡易後座力操作機制的傳統半自動手槍，具備卓越的可靠性。此槍為 Nanotrasen 站點安保及緊急應變小組的標準配槍，使用 .35 口徑手槍彈匣供彈。 | Designed by Nanotrasen’s Small Arms Division, the Mk58 is a conventional semi-automatic pistol with a simple recoil-operated action and excellent reliability. The standard sidearm of Nanotrasen’s station security and emergency response teams. Feeds from .35 pistol magazines.
ent-WeaponPistolN1984 = N1984 | N1984
    .desc = 這是一款作為納諾特拉森（Nanotrasen）BFG計畫一環所設計的、威力極其強大的「手持加農砲」。其口徑為.45——即「領主口徑」——一般認為這把槍過於笨重，不適合常規使用，但在納諾特拉森高層之間卻已成為某種地位象徵。彈匣採用.45手槍彈匣供彈。 | An exceptionally powerful ‘hand cannon’ designed as part of Nanotrasen's BFG initiative. Chambered in .45, the lord’s caliber, it is generally considered too unwieldy for standard use but has become something of a status symbol among Nanotrasen officials. Feeds from .45 pistol magazines.
ent-WeaponImprovisedPneumaticCannon = 自製氣動砲 | improvised pneumatic cannon
    .desc = 僅憑一根管子、幾條束線帶和一門氣動砲就臨時改裝而成。若氣罐氣量不足，則無法接收。 | Improvised using nothing but a pipe, some zipties, and a pneumatic cannon. Doesn't accept tanks without enough gas.
ent-LauncherCreamPie = 派炮 | pie cannon
    .desc = 為獲得最佳效果，請加入奶油派。 | Load cream pie for optimal results.
    .suffix = Empty
ent-BorgLauncherCreamPie = 實驗性派炮 | experimental pie cannon
    .desc = 直接將一大份鮮奶油送給船員們！會隨著時間自動烘烤派。 | Deliver a generous portion of cream directly to the crew! Automatically bakes pies over time.
ent-LauncherSyringe = 注射槍 | syringe gun
    .desc = 裝滿摻毒的注射器，享受極致的樂趣。 | Load full of poisoned syringes for optimal fun.
