ent-BaseWeaponRevolver = 基礎武器：左輪手槍 | BaseWeaponRevolver
    .desc = 一款超棒的隨拍相機。 | A rooty tooty point and shooty.
ent-WeaponRevolverDeckard = 德卡德 | Deckard
    .desc = 一把工藝精湛、量身訂製的左輪手槍。當無暇進行沃伊特-坎普夫測試時便會使用。可裝填 5 發 .45 馬格南子彈。 | A beautifully machined, custom-built revolver. Used when there is no time for the Voight-Kampff test. Loads 5 rounds of .45 magnum.
ent-WeaponRevolverInspector = 督察 | Inspector
    .desc = 一款由多家公司生產的雙動式左輪手槍。此槍在民用市場上隨處可見，因此深受私家偵探青睞。光是握在手中，便讓人覺得好運眷顧。可裝填 6 發 .45 馬格南子彈。 | A double-action revolver manufactured by various companies. It is readily available on the civilian market, making it a popular choice among private investigators. You feel lucky just holding it. Loads 6 rounds of .45 magnum.
ent-WeaponRevolverMateba = 馬特巴 | Mateba
    .desc = 這是納諾特雷森（Nanotrasen）轄下近乎傳說般的「死亡小隊」特種部隊所使用的現代左輪手槍。其獨特的扳機機構與槍管配置，使其能在槍口上揚極小的前提下，達到極高的射速。許多人曾直面這支槍管，但鮮少有人能倖存下來講述這段經歷。可裝填 6 發 .45 馬格南子彈。 | A modern revolver used by Nanotrasen’s elite, near mythical ‘Death Squad’ task force. Its unique trigger action and barrel placement enable a high fire rate with minimal muzzle flip. Many have looked down this barrel, but few have lived to tell of it. Loads 6 rounds of .45 magnum.
ent-WeaponRevolverMatebaAP = { ent-WeaponRevolverMateba }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponRevolverMateba.desc }
    .suffix = armor-piercing
ent-WeaponRevolverPython = Python | Python
    .desc = 一款由「辛迪加」製造的強大雙動式左輪手槍。聲勢浩大且耀眼奪目，非常適合任何想要展現存在感的特工。可裝填 6 發 .45 馬格南子彈。 | A powerful double-action revolver manufactured by the Syndicate. Loud and flashy, perfect for any agent looking to make a statement. Loads 6 rounds of .45 magnum.
ent-WeaponRevolverPythonAP = { ent-WeaponRevolverPython }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponRevolverPython.desc }
    .suffix = armor-piercing
ent-WeaponRevolverPirate = 海盜左輪手槍 | pirate revolver
    .desc = 一把由太空海盜親手打造的粗糙單動式左輪手槍。雖然年代久遠且鏽跡斑斑，卻不知為何仍能正常運作。可裝填 5 發 .45 馬格南子彈。 | A crude single-action revolver handmade by a space pirate. Old and covered in rust, it somehow still works. Loads 5 rounds of .45 magnum.
ent-WeaponRevolverPirateEmpty = { ent-WeaponRevolverPirate }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponRevolverPirate.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
ent-BaseWeaponRifle = 基礎武器：步槍 | BaseWeaponRifle
    .desc = 一款超棒的隨拍相機。 | A rooty tooty point and shooty.
ent-WeaponRifleAk = AKMS | AKMS
    .desc = 一款設計源自舊地球、外觀略顯破舊的戰鬥步槍。因其著稱的可靠性與易於製造的設計，深受罪犯、民兵及恐怖分子青睞。使用 .30 口徑步槍彈匣供彈。 | A somewhat battered combat rifle of a design originating from old Earth. Favored by criminals, militias, and terrorists due to its famed reliability and easy-to-manufacture design. Feeds from .30 rifle magazines.
ent-WeaponRifleLecter = 萊克特 | Lecter
    .desc =
        一款廣受歡迎的氣動式戰鬥步槍，被納諾特拉森（Nanotrasen）和索爾政府（SolGov）廣泛使用。該槍可進行半自動或全自動射擊，其精準度、制止力及可靠性使其在各類環境中表現卓越。
        使用 .20 口徑步槍彈匣供彈。 | Popular gas-operated combat rifle used heavily by Nanotrasen and SolGov. Operating in semi or fully automatic, its accuracy, stopping power, and reliability make it excel in all manner of environments.
        Feeds from .20 rifle magazines.
ent-WeaponRifleLecterXL8 = XL8 | XL8
    .desc = The Experimental Lecter 8 An unreasonably expensive military grade assault rifle with integrated optic. Uses .20 rifle ammo.
ent-WeaponRifleEstoc = Estoc DMR | Estoc DMR
    .desc =
        一款以三發點射模式射擊的指定狙擊步槍。「Estoc」是作為「Lecter」的遠程對應型號而設計，配備延長至 20 英吋的槍管及望遠瞄準鏡。
        使用 .20 口徑步槍彈匣供彈。 | A designated marksman rifle firing in 3-round bursts. The Estoc was designed as the Lecter’s long-range counterpart, equipped with an extended 20-inch barrel and telescopic sight.
        Feeds from .20 rifle magazines.
ent-BaseWeaponShotgun = 基礎武器：霰彈槍 | BaseWeaponShotgun
    .desc = 一款超棒的隨拍相機。 | A rooty tooty point and shooty.
ent-WeaponShotgunBulldog = 鬥牛犬 | Bulldog
    .desc = 一款專為近距離作戰設計的自動彈匣供彈霰彈槍。後座力強得像一匹吃了類固醇的騾子。使用.50口徑霰彈槍彈。 | An automatic magazine-fed shotgun for close-quarters combat. Kicks like a mule on steroids. Uses .50 shotgun shells.
ent-WeaponShotgunDoubleBarreled = 雙管獵槍 | double-barreled shotgun
    .desc = 一部不朽的經典之作。使用.50口徑霰彈槍彈。 | An immortal classic. Uses .50 shotgun shells.
ent-WeaponShotgunDoubleBarreledRubber = 雙管獵槍 | double-barreled shotgun
    .desc = 一部不朽的經典之作。使用.50口徑霰彈槍彈。 | An immortal classic. Uses .50 shotgun shells.
    .suffix = Non-Lethal
ent-WeaponShotgunEnforcer = 執法者 | Enforcer
    .desc = 一款頂級半自動霰彈槍，更是所有安全部隊的驕傲。使用 .50 口徑霰彈槍彈。 | A premium semi-automatic shotgun, and the pride of all security forces. Uses .50 shotgun shells.
ent-WeaponShotgunEnforcerRubber = { ent-WeaponShotgunEnforcer }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponShotgunEnforcer.desc }
    .suffix = Non-Lethal
ent-WeaponShotgunKammerer = 卡默勒 | Kammerer
    .desc = 一款經典而可靠的设计，深受許多世界中非正規部隊的青睞。使用.50口徑霰彈槍彈。 | An old yet faithful design, and a favorite among irregular forces of many worlds. Uses .50 shotgun shells.
ent-WeaponShotgunSawn = 鋸短霰彈槍 | sawn-off shotgun
    .desc = 太酷了！使用.50口徑霰彈槍彈。 | Groovy! Uses .50 shotgun shells.
ent-WeaponShotgunSawnEmpty = 鋸短霰彈槍 | sawn-off shotgun
    .desc = 太酷了！使用.50口徑霰彈槍彈。 | Groovy! Uses .50 shotgun shells.
    .suffix = Empty
ent-WeaponShotgunHandmade = 手工製手槍 | handmade pistol
    .desc = 看起來不太可靠。使用.50口徑霰彈槍彈。 | Looks unreliable. Uses .50 shotgun shells.
ent-WeaponShotgunBlunderbuss = 短管火槍 | blunderbuss
    .desc = 在近距離內極具殺傷力。 | Deadly at close range.
    .suffix = Pirate
ent-WeaponShotgunImprovised = 自製霰彈槍 | improvised shotgun
    .desc = 一把爛透了、手工打造的霰彈槍，使用 .50 口徑霰彈槍彈。槍膛內僅能裝填一發子彈。 | A shitty, hand-made shotgun that uses .50 shotgun shells. It can only hold one round in the chamber.
ent-WeaponShotgunImprovisedLoaded = 自製霰彈槍 | improvised shotgun
    .desc = { ent-WeaponShotgunImprovised.desc }
    .suffix = Loaded
ent-WeaponShotgunHushpup = Hushpup | Hushpup
    .desc = 一款鮮為人知的「執法者」改裝型，配備了實驗性消音器。非常適合那些道德標準嚴格的人。使用.50口徑霰彈槍彈。 | An obscure modification of the Enforcer, fitted with an experimental muffler. Great for those with a strict moral code. Uses .50 shotgun shells.
ent-BaseWeaponSubMachineGun = 基礎衝鋒槍 | BaseSMG
    .desc = 一款超棒的隨拍相機。 | A rooty tooty point and shooty.
ent-WeaponSubMachineGunAtreides = 阿特雷德家族 | Atreides
    .desc = 一款源自「企業戰爭」時期的稀有衝鋒手槍。其極高的射速與緊湊的機身設計，使其在近身戰中極具實用性。儘管年代久遠，但保存狀況卻出奇地良好。使用 .35 口徑衝鋒槍彈匣供彈。 | A rare machine pistol hailing from the Corporate Wars. Its extremely high fire rate and compact profile make it useful in close quarters combat. Despite its age, it is in remarkably good condition. Feeds from .35 SMG magazines.
ent-WeaponSubMachineGunC20r = C-20r 衝鋒槍 | C-20r submachine gun
    .desc = 一款經典且廣泛使用的衝鋒槍，因被「戈勒克斯掠奪者」所使用而臭名昭著。這是「華夫公司」最早的自主設計之一，至今仍服役中。使用 .35 SMG 彈匣供彈。 | A classic and widespread submachine gun, infamous for its use by the Gorlex Marauders. One of the first homegrown Waffle Corp. designs, it remains in service today. Feeds from .35 SMG magazines.
ent-WeaponSubMachineGunC20rROW = C-20r 通行權
    .desc = 一款供賽博格使用的 C-20r 連發衝鋒槍。透過內建的彈藥製造器即時生成 .35 口徑彈藥，該製造器會緩慢地自動重新裝填。 | A burst-fire C-20r submachine gun for use by cyborgs. Creates .35 caliber ammo on the fly from an internal ammo fabricator, which slowly self-charges.
ent-WeaponSubMachineGunDrozd = Drozd | Drozd
    .desc = 一款由納諾特森（Nanotrasen）輕武器部門製造的現代衝鋒槍。其連發模式下擁有卓越的射速，既可用於守住防禦陣地，也能在較遠距離對敵人展開攻擊。使用 .35 衝鋒槍彈匣供彈。 | A modern SMG manufactured by Nanotrasen’s Small Arms Division. It features an exceptional rate of fire in burst mode, useful for holding defensive angles or engaging hostiles at longer ranges. Feeds from .35 SMG magazines.
ent-WeaponSubMachineGunWt550 = WT550 | WT550
    .desc = WT550 是一款真正獨特的槍械，由 Nanotrasen 的小型武器部門設計，是一款可單手完全操控的緊湊型衝鋒槍。它採用了獨特的內部後座緩衝裝置，並使用特製的頂置式 .35 口徑彈匣供彈。 | A truly unique firearm, the WT550 was designed by Nanotrasen's Small Arms Division as a compact submachine gun fully controllable with one hand. It contains an exotic internal recoil buffer and feeds from special top-mounted .35 magazines.
ent-WeaponSubMachineGunBriefcase = 棕色公事包 | brown briefcase
    .desc = 方便您用手攜帶物品。 | Useful for carrying items in your hands.
    .suffix = Gun
ent-BaseWeaponSniper = 基礎武器：狙擊槍 | BaseWeaponSniper
    .desc = 一款超棒的隨拍相機。 | A rooty tooty point and shooty.
ent-WeaponSniperMosin = 卡達謝夫-莫辛 | Kardashev-Mosin
    .desc = 卡達謝夫-莫辛步槍堪稱真正的歷史遺珍，自670年前問世以來，幾乎參與過每一場武裝衝突。無論是用於狩獵、狙擊，還是無休止的壕溝戰，這支步槍的栓動式設計幾乎與原始設計完全相同。可裝填10發.30口徑步槍子彈。 | A true relic, the Kardashev-Mosin has served in nearly every armed conflict since its creation 670 years ago. The bolt-action design of the rifle remains virtually identical to its original design, whether used for hunting, sniping, or endless trench warfare. Loads 10 rounds of .30 rifle.
ent-WeaponSniperHristov = 赫里斯托夫 | Hristov
    .desc = 當你絕對、務必得在安全距離外，讓某人為自己的人生抉擇感到後悔時。使用 .60 口徑反器材彈藥。 | For when you absolutely, positively need to make someone regret their life choices from a safe distance. Uses .60 anti-materiel ammo.
ent-Musket = 火槍 | musket
    .desc = 這東西早在你出生之前就該被收進博物館了。使用.60口徑的反器材彈藥。 | This should've been in a museum long before you were born. Uses .60 anti-materiel ammo.
ent-WeaponPistolFlintlock = 燧發手槍 | flintlock pistol
    .desc = 海盜的夥伴。哇噠！使用 .45 馬格南子彈。 | A pirate's companion. Yarrr! Uses .45 magnum ammo.
ent-WeaponPistolFlintlockEmpty = { ent-WeaponPistolFlintlock }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponPistolFlintlock.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
ent-WeaponTileGun = 瓷磚槍 | tile gun
    .desc = 一把能射出磁磚的奇特槍。用地板把牠們打飛吧！ | A strange gun that shoots tiles. Shoot them with the floor!
ent-WeaponTileGunEmpty = { ent-WeaponTileGun }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponTileGun.desc }
    .suffix = empty
ent-WeaponTurretSyndicate = { ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurret }
    .desc = { ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurret.desc }
    .suffix = Syndicate
ent-WeaponTurretSyndicateDisposable = 一次性防彈砲塔 | disposable ballistic turret
    .desc = { ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurretIndestructible.desc }
    .suffix = Syndicate, Disposable
ent-WeaponTurretNanoTrasen = { ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurret }
    .desc = { ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurret.desc }
    .suffix = NanoTrasen
ent-WeaponTurretHostile = { ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurret }
    .desc = { ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurret.desc }
    .suffix = Hostile
ent-WeaponTurretAllHostile = { ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurret }
    .desc = { ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurret.desc }
    .suffix = All hostile
ent-WeaponTurretXeno = 外星炮塔 | xeno turret
    .desc = 可發射 9 毫米酸彈。 | Shoots 9mm acid projectiles.
    .suffix = Xeno
ent-BaseWeaponTurretIndestructible = 炮塔 | turret
    .desc = { ent-BaseStructure.desc }
ent-BaseTurretDestructible = { ent-StructureHealthMachineStrong }
    .desc = { ent-StructureHealthMachineStrong.desc }
ent-BaseWeaponTurret = { ent-BaseWeaponTurretIndestructible }
    .desc = { ent-BaseWeaponTurretIndestructible.desc }
ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurretIndestructible = 彈道炮塔 | ballistic turret
    .desc = 一具彈道機槍自動轉塔。 | A ballistic machine gun auto-turret.
ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurret = { ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurretIndestructible }
    .desc = { ent-BaseWeaponBallisticTurretIndestructible.desc }
ent-BaseWeaponEnergyTurretIndestructible = 雷射轉塔 | laser turret
    .desc = 一具配備重型雷射的自動炮塔。只要連接至運作中的電力網，其武器便會自動充電。 | An auto-turret armed with a heavy laser. Its weapon will recharge while connected to an active power grid.
ent-BaseWeaponEnergyTurret = { ent-BaseWeaponEnergyTurretIndestructible }
    .desc = { ent-BaseWeaponEnergyTurretIndestructible.desc }
ent-WeaponTurretSyndicateBroken = 彈道砲塔（損壞） | ballistic turret (broken)
    .desc = 一具彈道機槍自動轉塔。 | A ballistic machine gun auto-turret.
ent-WeaponEnergyTurretStationBase = 哨兵砲塔 | sentry turret
    .desc = 一種專為防止未經授權人員進入敏感區域而設計的高科技自主武器系統。 | A high-tech autonomous weapons system designed to keep unauthorized personnel out of sensitive areas.
ent-WeaponEnergyTurretAI = { ent-WeaponEnergyTurretStationBase }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponEnergyTurretStationBase.desc }
    .suffix = AI, Silicon
ent-WeaponEnergyTurretSecurity = { ent-WeaponEnergyTurretStationBase }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponEnergyTurretStationBase.desc }
    .suffix = Security
ent-WeaponEnergyTurretCommand = { ent-WeaponEnergyTurretStationBase }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponEnergyTurretStationBase.desc }
    .suffix = Command
ent-ArmBlade = 臂刃 | arm blade
    .desc = 一把由骨頭和血肉製成的怪誕利刃，既能撬開門扉，也能如熱刀切奶油般輕易劈開人體。 | A grotesque blade made out of bone and flesh that can pry open doors and cleaves through people as a hot knife through butter.
ent-WeaponBaguette = { ent-FoodBreadBaguette }
    .desc = { ent-FoodBreadBaguette.desc }
    .suffix = Weapon
ent-BaseBallBat = 棒球棍 | baseball bat
    .desc = 一支結實耐用的棒球棒。 | A robust baseball bat.
ent-IncompleteBaseBallBat = 不完整的棒球棒 | incomplete baseball bat
    .desc = 幾塊木板拼湊在一起。 | A few planks of wood stuck together.
ent-WeaponMeleeKnockbackStick = 擊退棍 | knockback stick
    .desc = 接著，他就在各處打起盹來。 | And then he spleefed all over.
ent-Cane = 手杖 | cane
    .desc = 一根木拐杖。 | A wooden cane.
ent-CaneBlade = 甘蔗刀片 | cane blade
    .desc = 一把刀刃鋒利、握柄呈手杖狀的刀。 | A sharp blade with a cane shaped hilt.
ent-CaneSheath = { ent-Cane }
    .desc = { ent-Cane.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
ent-CaneSheathFilled = { ent-CaneSheath }
    .desc = { ent-CaneSheath.desc }
    .suffix = Filled
ent-Chainsaw = 鏈鋸 | chainsaw
    .desc = 一台非常大的鏈鋸。通常用它來砍樹……通常是這樣。 | A very large chainsaw. Usually you use this for cutting down trees... usually.
ent-RitualDagger = 儀式匕首 | ritual dagger
    .desc = 一把奇特的匕首，常被邪惡組織用於儀式與獻祭。 | A strange dagger used by sinister groups for rituals and sacrifices.
ent-EldritchBlade = 詭異之刃 | eldritch blade
    .desc = 一把迸發著邪惡能量的嗡鳴之劍。 | A sword humming with unholy energy.
ent-UnholyHalberd = 不聖之鉞 | unholy halberd
    .desc = 一把似乎與其持有者息息相關的戰斧。 | A poleaxe that seems to be linked to its wielder.
ent-BaseMeleeWeaponEnergy = { ent-BaseItem }
    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
ent-EnergySword = 能量劍 | energy sword
    .desc = 一把聲響極大且極其危險的劍，其光束由純淨、高濃度的等離子體構成。能像切黃油般輕易切開未穿戴護甲的目標。 | A very loud & dangerous sword with a beam made of pure, concentrated plasma. Cuts through unarmored targets like butter.
ent-EnergyDaggerLoud = 能量匕首 | energy dagger
    .desc = 一把光束由純淨、高濃度等離子體構成，但聲響較小且危險性較低的匕首。這把匕首完全沒有偽裝。 | A not as loud and dangerous dagger with a beam made of pure, concentrated plasma. This one is completely undisguised.
ent-EnergyDagger = 筆 | pen
    .desc = 一支深色墨水筆。 | A dark ink pen.
    .suffix = E-Dagger
ent-EnergyDaggerBox = e-dagger 盒子 | e-dagger box
    .desc = 一個裝有電子匕首的小盒子。包裝在打開時會自行分解，不留任何痕跡。 | A small box containing an e-dagger. Packaging disintegrates when opened, leaving no evidence behind.
    .suffix = E-Dagger
ent-EnergyCutlass = 能量短劍 | energy cutlass
    .desc = 一種異域風格的能量武器。 | An exotic energy weapon.
ent-EnergySwordDouble = 雙刃能量劍 | double-bladed energy sword
    .desc = 「辛迪加指揮部」的實習生們認為，能量劍上只有一把劍刃還不夠。這把劍可以收進口袋裡。 | Syndicate Command Interns thought that having one blade on the energy sword was not enough. This can be stored in pockets.
ent-HyperEutacticBlade = 超共晶葉片 | hypereutactic-blade
    .desc = 這是一種被設想為能將時空結構本身一分為二的超巨大武器，這把超共晶刀能動態地以閃速鍛造出超共晶結晶納米結構，能夠像熱刀切黃油般輕易穿透大多數已知的物質形態。 | A supermassive weapon envisioned to cleave the very fabric of space and time itself in twain, the hypereutactic blade dynamically flash-forges a hypereutactic crystaline nanostructure capable of passing through most known forms of matter like a hot knife through butter.
ent-CyborgEnergySword = { ent-EnergySword }
    .desc = 一把極其轟鳴且危險的劍，其光束由純淨、高濃度的等離子體構成。專為辛迪加賽博格設計。 | A very loud & dangerous sword with a beam made of pure, concentrated plasma. Specially designed for syndicate cyborgs.
    .suffix = For Borgs
ent-CyborgEnergySwordDouble = { ent-EnergySwordDouble }
    .desc = 「辛迪加指揮部」的實習生們認為，能量劍上僅有一把刀刃還不夠。此款專為辛迪加賽博格設計。 | Syndicate Command Interns thought that having one blade on the energy sword was not enough. Specially designed for syndicate cyborgs.
    .suffix = One-Handed, For Borgs
ent-EnergyDaggerLoudBlue = { ent-EnergyDaggerLoud }
    .desc = { ent-EnergyDaggerLoud.desc }
    .suffix = blue
ent-FireAxe = 消防斧 | fireaxe
    .desc = 這確實是瘋子的武器。誰會想到用斧頭來火攻呢？ | Truly, the weapon of a madman. Who would think to fight fire with an axe?
ent-FireAxeFlaming = 消防斧 | fire axe
    .desc = 既然可以同時用火和斧頭對抗火勢，何必只用斧頭來撲火呢？現已配備堅固耐用的橡膠握柄！ | Why fight fire with an axe when you can fight with fire and axe? Now featuring rugged rubberized handle!
ent-Gohei = gohei | gohei
    .desc = 一根木棍，末端繫有白色流蘇。原本由神社の巫女用來淨化物品。如今則被太空站裡的御宅族所使用。 | A wooden stick with white streamers at the end. Originally used by shrine maidens to purify things. Now used by the station's weeaboos.
ent-Sledgehammer = 大錘 | sledgehammer
    .desc = 進行肆意屠殺的完美工具。 | The perfect tool for wanton carnage.
ent-Mjollnir = Mjollnir | Mjollnir
    .desc = 這是一件配得上神明的武器，能以閃電般的威力發動攻擊。它蘊含著難以遏制的能量，表面噼啪作響。 | A weapon worthy of a god, able to strike with the force of a lightning bolt. It crackles with barely contained energy.
ent-SingularityHammer = 奇點之錘 | Singularity Hammer
    .desc = 作為近身格鬥技術的巔峰之作，這把戰鎚運用微型奇點的力量，能打出毀滅性的重擊。 | The pinnacle of close combat technology, the hammer harnesses the power of a miniaturized singularity to deal crushing blows.
ent-BaseKnife = { ent-BaseItem }
    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
ent-KitchenKnife = 廚房刀 | kitchen knife
    .desc = 由 Asters Merchant Guild 製造的一把通用型主廚刀。保證未來多年都能保持鋒利。 | A general purpose Chef's Knife made by Asters Merchant Guild. Guaranteed to stay sharp for years to come..
ent-ButchCleaver = 屠夫的菜刀 | butcher's cleaver
    .desc = 一把用於剁切和切碎肉類的巨大刀。其適用對象包括小丑及其衍生產品。 | A huge blade used for chopping and chopping up meat. This includes clowns and clown-by-products.
ent-CombatKnife = 戰鬥刀 | combat knife
    .desc = 一把專為近身搏鬥設計的致命刀具。 | A deadly knife intended for melee confrontations.
ent-SurvivalKnife = 求生刀 | survival knife
    .desc = 對抗太空鯉魚的首選暨最終手段。 | Weapon of first and last resort for combatting space carp.
ent-KukriKnife = 庫克里刀 | kukri knife
    .desc = 專業人士有其標準。要彬彬有禮。要高效。並要擬定計畫，將你遇到的每個人都殺光。 | Professionals have standards. Be polite. Be efficient. Have a plan to kill everyone you meet.
ent-XenoborgBioKnife = 生物刀 | bio knife
    .desc = 會與特定代謝型目標融合，並對這些目標造成額外傷害！ | Melds itself to specific metabolizers and will deal extra damage to those targets!
ent-BladedFlatcapGrey = 灰色平頂帽 | grey flatcap
    .desc = 無論是勞工階級還是老詹金斯，這頂帽子都十分時髦。帽簷裡藏著玻璃碎片。 | Fashionable for both the working class and old man Jenkins. It has glass shards hidden in the brim.
    .suffix = Bladed
ent-BladedFlatcapBrown = 棕色平頂帽 | brown flatcap
    .desc = 「笨小丑！你讓我丟臉了！」帽簷裡藏著玻璃碎片。 | "Stupid clown! You made me look bad!" It has glass shards hidden in the brim.
    .suffix = { ent-BladedFlatcapGrey.suffix }
ent-Shiv = 自製小刀 | shiv
    .desc = 一件由布條和玻璃碎片製成的粗陋武器。 | A crude weapon fashioned from a piece of cloth and a glass shard.
ent-ReinforcedShiv = 加固的自製小刀 | reinforced shiv
    .desc = 一種由一塊布和一片強化玻璃碎片製成的粗糙武器。 | A crude weapon fashioned from a piece of cloth and a reinforced glass shard.
ent-PlasmaShiv = 等離子小刀 | plasma shiv
    .desc = 一種用一塊布和一塊等離子玻璃碎片製成的粗糙武器。 | A crude weapon fashioned from a piece of cloth and a plasma glass shard.
ent-UraniumShiv = 鈾製小刀 | uranium shiv
    .desc = 一種用布片和鈾玻璃碎片製成的粗糙武器。這違反了《日內瓦公約》！ | A crude weapon fashioned from a piece of cloth and a uranium glass shard. Violates the geneva convention!
ent-ThrowingKnife = 飛刀 | throwing knife
    .desc = 這把血紅色的刀流線型極佳，擲起來很輕鬆，但若想拿它與人近身搏鬥，那可就祝你好運了。 | This blood-red knife is very aerodynamic and easy to throw, but good luck trying to fight someone hand-to-hand.
ent-UtilityKnife = 多功能刀 | utility knife
    .desc = 一把配備可伸縮微型刀片的刀具。除了用作開箱刀和拆信刀之外，還有其他用途。 | A knife with a retractable, tiny blade. Useful as a box cutter and letter opener, among other things.
ent-Pickaxe = 鎬 | pickaxe
    .desc = 切口精準無瑕，專為卡入岩石而設計。 | Notched to perfection, for jamming it into rocks.
ent-MiningDrill = 採礦鑽機 | mining drill
    .desc = 一種用於快速鑽穿岩石的強力工具。 | Powerful tool used to quickly drill through rocks.
ent-MiningDrillDiamond = 金剛石鑽頭 | diamond tipped mining drill
    .desc = 一款效率顯著提升、鑲有鑽石的採礦鑽頭。 | A significantly more efficient mining drill tipped with diamond.
ent-BaseWeaponCrusher = 破碎機 | crusher
    .desc = 原型動能加速器的早期設計。 | An early design of the proto-kinetic accelerator.
ent-WeaponCrusher = { ent-BaseWeaponCrusher }
    .desc = { ent-BaseWeaponCrusher.desc }
ent-WeaponCrusherDagger = 粉碎匕首 | crusher dagger
    .desc = 一種原型動能粉碎機的縮小版。利用動能使刀片高速振動。 | A scaled down version of a proto-kinetic crusher. Uses kinetic energy to vibrate the blade at high speeds.
ent-WeaponCrusherGlaive = 粉碎長鎚 | crusher glaive
    .desc = 原型動能加速器的早期設計，呈長矛形狀。能提供更佳的治療效果，但代價是帶電傷害較低。 | An early design of the proto-kinetic accelerator, in glaive form. Provides better healing in exchange for less charged damage.
ent-WeaponMeleeNeedle = 官方安全防充氣式武器 | official security anti-inflatable armament
    .desc = 一種專門用於摧毀辛迪加獨有士氣提升設備的特殊武器。 | A specialty weapon used in the destruction of unique syndicate morale-boosting equipment.
ent-OffsetCane = 標準偏移手杖 | standard offset cane
    .desc = 一支標準的偏心手杖，當雙腿無法勝任行走任務時，它是行動不可或缺的輔助工具。至於能否因此賦予你長者的智慧，那就不得而知了。 | A standard offset cane, essential for getting around when your legs aren't up to the task. May or may not grant you the wisdom of the elderly.
ent-OffsetCaneClown = 彩虹漸變手杖 | rainbow offset cane
    .desc = 一支彩虹色偏移手杖，非常適合小丑，以及那些喜歡在生活中增添一抹色彩的人。 | A rainbow offset cane, perfect for clowns and those who enjoy a splash of color in their lives.
ent-OffsetCaneMime = 條紋偏心手杖 | striped offset cane
    .desc = 一根黑白條紋手杖，非常適合用於無聲表演。 | A black and white striped cane, perfect for silent performances.
ent-OffsetCaneNT = nanotrasen 偏心手杖 | nanotrasen offset cane
    .desc = 一款印有 NT 標誌的 Nanotrasen 標準款偏心手杖，深受偏好較為正式風格的人士青睞。 | A nanotrasen standard issue offset cane with the NT logo, favored by those who prefer a more corporate look.
ent-OffsetCaneWood = 木製偏心手杖 | wooden offset cane
    .desc = 一支木製偏心手杖，對於鍾愛天然材質與穩固握感的人而言，是經典之選。 | A wooden offset cane, a classic choice for those who appreciate natural materials and a sturdy grip.
ent-Spear = 長矛 | spear
    .desc = 經典之作的定義。自公元前200,000年起，讓謀殺始終物美價廉。 | Definition of a Classic. Keeping murder affordable since 200,000 BCE.
ent-SpearReinforced = 加固長矛 | reinforced spear
    .desc = 一支以強化玻璃碎片作為矛尖的長矛。 | A spear with a reinforced glass shard as a tip.
ent-SpearPlasma = 等離子長矛 | plasma spear
    .desc = 一支矛，矛尖鑲有等離子碎片。 | A spear with a plasma shard as a tip.
ent-SpearUranium = 鈾矛 | uranium spear
    .desc = 一支以鈾片作為矛尖的長矛。 | A spear with a uranium shard as a tip.
ent-SpearBone = 骨矛 | bone spear
    .desc = 一支用骨頭製成的長矛。 | A spear made of bones.
ent-SpearSharkMinnow = 太空黑鯊牙矛 | sharkminnow tooth spear
    .desc = 一支以太空黑鯊牙齒作為矛尖的長矛。 | A spear with a sharkminnow tooth as a tip.
ent-Stunprod = 電擊棒 | stun prod
    .desc = 一種用於非法致人喪失行動能力的電擊棒。 | A stun prod for illegal incapacitation.
ent-BaseSword = { ent-BaseItem }
    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
ent-Cutlass = 短劍 | cutlass
    .desc = 一把彎曲得極其詭異的刀刃，常見於太空海盜手中。 | A wickedly curved blade, often seen in the hands of space pirates.
ent-Machete = 開山刀 | machete
    .desc = 一把龐大且看起來極其凶惡的刀。 | A large, vicious looking blade.
ent-CaptainSabre = 船長軍刀 | captain's sabre
    .desc = 這是該站站長的一件禮儀武器。 | A ceremonial weapon belonging to the captain of the station.
ent-Katana = katana | katana
    .desc = 以並非十分古老的塑鋼製成的古法工藝品。 | Ancient craftwork made with not so ancient plasteel.
ent-EnergyKatana = 能量刀 | energy katana
    .desc = 一把蘊含強大能量的日本刀。 | A katana infused with strong energy.
ent-Claymore = 克萊莫 | claymore
    .desc = 一把古戰刀。 | An ancient war blade.
ent-Throngler = throngler | throngler
    .desc = 如果保安膽敢從你那裡拿走它，就提醒他們，他們終究也是凡人。 | If Security dares take it from you, just remind them that they are indeed mortal.
ent-WeaponMeleeToolboxRobust = 功能強大的工具箱 | robust toolbox
    .desc = 潮汐者的武器。 | A tider's weapon.
ent-WhiteCane = 白手杖 | white cane
    .desc = 這不是給你的。這是給那些當你問「貨運部是酒吧嗎」時，卻還是搞不清楚你其實是盲人的那些人。 | This isn't for you. It's for the people who can't figure out you're blind when you ask if cargo is the bar.
ent-Stunbaton = 電擊棒 | stun baton
    .desc = 一種用於使人喪失行動能力的電擊棒。若以此主動傷害他人，則被視為有失體統。 | A stun baton for incapacitating people with. Actively harming with this is considered bad tone.
ent-Truncheon = 警棍 | truncheon
    .desc = 一根堅硬、鑲有鋼釘的警棍，旨在傷害他人。 | A rigid, steel-studded baton, meant to harm.
ent-Flash = flash | flash
    .desc = 一款附有觸發裝置的超亮閃光燈，能使受害者暫時目眩並喪失視力。一旦燒壞便無法使用。 | An ultrabright flashbulb with a trigger, which causes the victim to be dazed and lose their eyesight for a moment. Useless when burnt out.
ent-SciFlash = flash | flash
    .desc = { ent-Flash.desc }
    .suffix = 2 charges
ent-PortableFlasher = 便攜式閃光燈 | portable flasher
    .desc = 一款配備接近感應觸發器的超亮閃光燈，可用於將特定區域設定為僅限安保人員進入。 | An ultrabright flashbulb with a proximity trigger, useful for making an area security-only.
ent-GrenadeBase = { ent-BaseItem }
    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
ent-TimerGrenadeBase = { ent-GrenadeBase }
    .desc = { ent-GrenadeBase.desc }
ent-ImpactGrenadeBase = { ent-GrenadeBase }
    .desc = { ent-GrenadeBase.desc }
