    .desc = { "" }
ent-FragileGrenadeBase = { "" }
    .desc = { "" }
ent-BaseBola = bola | bola
    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
ent-Bola = 臨時製作的波拉 | makeshift bola
    .desc = 一個用一些多餘的手銬和金屬片臨時拼湊而成的波拉。看起來似乎撐不了多久就會散架。 | A makeshift bola, cobbled together with some spare cuffs and metal. It doesn't look like it's going to stay together for very long.
ent-SecurityBola = 戰術用波拉 | tactical bola
    .desc = 「A bola」由鋼製錨點透過鋼索相互連接而成。可靠且可重複使用。 | A bola, comprised of steel anchors linked together with a wire cable. Reliable and reusable.
ent-SmokeGrenade = 煙霧彈 | smoke grenade
    .desc = 一種戰術手榴彈，使用時會釋放出一大團持續時間較長的煙霧。 | A tactical grenade that releases a large, long-lasting cloud of smoke when used.
ent-CleanerGrenade = cleanade | cleanade
    .desc = 專為清潔人員設計的手榴彈，能釋放出大量太空清潔泡沫。 | Special grenade for janitors, releasing large cloud of space cleaner foam.
ent-TearGasGrenade = 催淚氣體手榴彈 | tear gas grenade
    .desc = 一枚鎮暴用催淚氣體手榴彈。會引起刺激感、疼痛，並讓你淚流不止。 | A riot control tear gas grenade. Causes irritation, pain and makes you cry your eyes out.
ent-MetalFoamGrenade = 金屬泡沫手榴彈 | metal foam grenade
    .desc = 一種用於以特殊快乾金屬泡沫修補船體破洞的緊急工具。效果幾乎和真正的地板一樣好！ | An emergency tool used for patching hull breaches with special quick-set metal foam. Almost as good as real floors!
ent-AirGrenade = 空氣手榴彈 | air grenade
    .desc = 一種特殊的固態化學手榴彈，用於將標準空氣迅速釋放至特定區域。可填滿多達 30 格！ | A special solid state chemical grenade used for quickly releasing standard air into a spaced area. Fills up to 30 tiles!
ent-WeaponCroissant = { ent-FoodBakedCroissant }
    .desc = { ent-FoodBakedCroissant.desc }
    .suffix = Weapon
ent-ExGrenade = 爆炸性手榴彈 | explosive grenade
    .desc = 一種能引發規模雖小卻極具破壞力的爆炸的手榴彈。 | Grenade that creates a small but devastating explosion.
ent-GrenadeFlashBang = 閃光震撼彈 | flashbang
    .desc = 嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚嗚 | Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee.
ent-GrenadeFlashEffect = { "" }
    .desc = { "" }
ent-SyndieMiniBomb = 「辛迪加」迷你炸彈 | syndicate minibomb
    .desc = 一種由犯罪集團製造的爆炸物，用於製造破壞並引發混亂。 | A syndicate-manufactured explosive used to stow destruction and cause chaos.
ent-SelfDestructSeq = 自我毀滅 | self destruct
    .desc = 按照自己的方式踏上旅程吧！ | Go out on your own terms!
ent-SingularityGrenade = 奇點手榴彈 | singularity grenade
    .desc = 一枚模擬奇點威力的手榴彈，能將周遭事物吸入一團。 | Grenade that simulates the power of a singularity, pulling things in a heap.
ent-WhiteholeGrenade = 白洞手榴彈 | whitehole grenade
    .desc = 一枚能將周圍的一切擊退一段時間的手榴彈。 | Grenade that repulses everything around for some time.
ent-NuclearGrenade = 「核選項」 | the nuclear option
    .desc = 請不要亂丟，請為孩子著想。 | Please don't throw it, think of the children.
ent-ModularGrenade = 模組化手榴彈 | modular grenade
    .desc = 一枚手榴彈彈殼。需搭配扳機和裝藥。 | A grenade casing. Requires a trigger and a payload.
ent-EmpGrenade = 電磁脈衝手榴彈 | EMP grenade
    .desc = 一款專為破壞電子系統而設計的手榴彈。 | A grenade designed to wreak havoc on electronic systems.
ent-HolyHandGrenade = 神聖的手榴彈 | holy hand grenade
    .desc = 主啊，求祢賜福於這枚祢的手榴彈，好讓祢能憑著祢的憐憫，藉此將祢的敵人炸得粉碎。 | O Lord, bless this thy hand grenade, that with it thou mayst blow thine enemies to tiny bits, in thy mercy.
ent-GrenadeDummy = 哄騙手榴彈 | trick grenade
    .desc = 擁有手榴彈的一切，卻沒有任何爆炸聲。 | All the grenade without any of the boom.
ent-SyndieTrickyBomb = 辛迪加「trickybomb」 | syndicate trickybomb
    .desc = 由辛迪加製造的爆炸物，用來製造極佳的混淆視聽效果。 | A syndicate-manufactured explosive used to make an excellent distraction.
ent-ProjectileGrenadeBase = { ent-BaseItem }
    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
ent-GrenadeStinger = 刺針手榴彈 | stinger grenade
    .desc = 這裡沒什麼可看的，請大家散開。 | Nothing to see here, please disperse.
ent-GrenadeIncendiary = 燃燒手榴彈 | incendiary grenade
    .desc = 保證能讓氣氛熱絡起來。 | Guaranteed to light up the mood.
ent-GrenadeShrapnel = 破片手榴彈 | shrapnel grenade
    .desc = 會釋放出致命的彈片噴射，造成嚴重出血。 | Releases a deadly spray of shrapnel that causes severe bleeding.
ent-ScatteringGrenadeBase = { ent-GrenadeBase }
    .desc = { ent-GrenadeBase.desc }
ent-ClusterBang = clusterbang | clusterbang
    .desc = 僅可與閃光彈搭配使用。會連續爆炸數次。 | Can be used only with flashbangs. Explodes several times.
ent-ClusterBangFull = clusterbang | clusterbang
    .desc = 計時器倒數結束後，會發射三枚閃光彈。 | Launches three flashbangs after the timer runs out.
    .suffix = Full
ent-ClusterGrenade = 集束手榴彈 | clustergrenade
    .desc = 既然可以一次用三顆手榴彈，何必只用一顆呢！ | Why use one grenade when you can use three at once!
ent-ClusterBananaPeel = 成簇的香蕉皮 | cluster banana peel
    .desc = 拋出後會分裂成 6 片爆裂的香蕉皮，保證好玩！ | Splits into 6 explosive banana peels after throwing, guaranteed fun!
ent-SlipocalypseClusterSoap = slipocalypse clustersoap | slipocalypse clustersoap
    .desc = 落地時，會將少量辛迪加肥皂碎塊灑散在地面上。 | Spreads small pieces of syndicate soap over an area upon landing on the floor.
ent-GrenadeFoamDart = 泡沫飛鏢手榴彈 | foam dart grenade
    .desc = 會釋放出一陣令人困擾的泡沫飛鏢，造成嚴重的嘔吐。 | Releases a bothersome spray of foam darts that cause severe welching.
ent-ThrowingStar = 飛鏢 | throwing star
    .desc = 這是一種自古以來沿用至今的武器，因為它很容易嵌入受害者的身體部位。 | An ancient weapon still used to this day, due to its ease of lodging itself into its victim's body parts.
ent-ThrowingStarNinja = 忍者飛鏢 | ninja throwing star
    .desc = { ent-ThrowingStar.desc }
