ent-BarSignComboCafe = Combo Cafe | Combo Cafe
    .desc = 在整個系統中，他們以那些毫無創意可言的飲品搭配而聞名。 | Renowned system-wide for their utterly uncreative drink combinations.
ent-BarSignEmergencyRumParty = 緊急朗姆酒派對 | Emergency Rum Party
    .desc = 在長期歇業後，最近重新取得營業執照。 | Recently relicensed after a long closure.
ent-BarSignLV426 = LV426 | LV426
    .desc = 戴著花俏的口罩喝酒，顯然比去醫務室更重要。 | Drinking with fancy facemasks is clearly more important than going to medbay.
ent-BarSignMaidCafe = 女僕咖啡廳 | Maid Cafe
    .desc = 歡迎回來，師傅！ | Welcome back, master!
ent-BarSignMalteseFalcon = 《馬爾他之鷹》 | Maltese Falcon
    .desc = 再放一次吧，山姆。 | Play it again, sam.
ent-BarSignOfficerBeersky = 比爾斯基警官 | Officer Beersky
    .desc = 老天爺啊，這些飲料真的超棒。 | Man eat a dong, these drinks are great.
ent-BarSignRobustaCafe = 羅布斯塔咖啡館 | Robusta Cafe
    .desc = 連續五年無人能破的「最致命酒吧鬥毆」紀錄保持者。 | Holder of the 'Most Lethal Barfights' record 5 years uncontested.
ent-BarSignTheAleNath = 《艾爾·納斯》 | The Ale Nath
    .desc = 好吧，老兄。我想你已經喝得夠多了。該叫計程車了。 | All right, buddy. I think you've had EI NATH. Time to get a cab.
ent-BarSignTheBirdCage = 《鳥籠》 | The Bird Cage
    .desc = 嘎嘎！ | Caw caw!
ent-BarSignTheCoderbus = Coderbus | The Coderbus
    .desc = 一家極具爭議的酒吧，以種類繁多且不斷更新的飲品而聞名。 | A very controversial bar known for its wide variety of constantly-changing drinks.
ent-BarSignTheDrunkCarp = 《醉鯉》 | The Drunk Carp
    .desc = 切勿邊喝酒邊游泳。 | Don't drink and swim.
ent-BarSignEngineChange = 引擎更換 | The Engine Change
    .desc = 還在等。 | Still waiting.
ent-BarSignTheHarmbaton = 哈姆巴頓 | The Harmbaton
    .desc = 無論是安檢人員還是乘客，都能享有一場絕佳的用餐體驗。 | A great dining experience for both security members and passengers.
ent-BarSignTheLightbulb = 燈泡 | The Lightbulb
    .desc = 一家深受「蛾族」和「莫夫族」喜愛的咖啡廳。曾因女調酒師使用樟腦球來保護她的備用制服，導致店家被迫歇業一週。 | A cafe popular among moths and moffs. Once shut down for a week after the bartender used mothballs to protect her spare uniforms.
ent-BarSignTheLooseGoose = 《漫步天鵝》 | The Loose Goose
    .desc = 喝到吐，和／或打破現實的法則！ | Drink till you puke and/or break the laws of reality!
ent-BarSignTheNet = 網路 | The Net
    .desc = 你似乎會不知不覺地沉浸其中好幾個小時。 | You just seem to get caught up in it for hours.
ent-BarSignTheOuterSpess = 《外層斯佩斯》 | The Outer Spess
    .desc = 這間酒吧其實並不在外太空。 | This bar isn't actually located in outer space.
ent-BarSignTheSingulo = 《辛古洛》 | The Singulo
    .desc = 那是那些寧可不被直呼其名的人們所去的地方。 | Where people go that'd rather not be called by their name.
ent-BarSignTheSun = 《太陽報》 | The Sun
    .desc = 對於這樣一家陰暗的酒吧來說，這裡的燈光倒顯得格外明亮，這實在有些諷刺。 | Ironically bright for such a shady bar.
ent-BarSignWiggleRoom = 迴旋餘地 | Wiggle Room
    .desc = MoMMIs 舞步超厲害。 | MoMMIs got moves.
ent-BarSignZocalo = 索卡洛 | Zocalo
    .desc = 先前位於斯佩斯梅里卡。 | Anteriormente ubicado en Spessmerica.
ent-BarSignEmprah = 4 《帝王》 | 4 The Emprah
    .desc = 無論是狂熱分子、異端分子，還是腦損傷的顧客，都對此樂此不疲。 | Enjoyed by fanatics, heretics, and brain-damaged patrons alike.
ent-BarSignSpacebucks = Spacebucks | Spacebucks
    .desc = 你根本無法擺脫他們，即使在太空中也是如此，即使我們後來改稱他們為「斯佩索」也一樣。 | You can't get away from them, even in space, and even after we started calling them 'spesos' instead.
ent-BarSignMaltroach = 《馬特羅克》 | The Maltroach
    .desc = 吱吱！ | Squeak!
ent-BarSignWhiskeyEchoes = 威士忌的迴響 | Whiskey Echoes
    .desc = 這是一家專為精英人士設立的酒吧——等等，這其實是 NanoTrasen 站。為什麼資料庫裡會有這個標誌？ | An elite bar for elite oper-wait, this is a Nanotrasen station. Why's this sign in the database?
ent-BarSignEmped = 出現故障的酒吧招牌 | glitchy bar sign
    .desc = 你心想，狠狠打一巴掌或許就能解決問題。 | You imagine a good smack might fix it.
