laws-owner-station = 太空站人員
laws-owner-beings = 生物
laws-owner-syndicate = 辛迪加特工
laws-owner-spider-clan = 蜘蛛族成員
laws-owner-heads = 各部門主管
laws-owner-legitimate-leadership = 正當的領導
laws-owner-others = 其他
laws-owner-public = 公眾人士
laws-owner-audience = 觀眾們
laws-owner-xenoborg-mothership = 母艦
